<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Sawltakte</book>
  <para style="h">Sawltakte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sawltakte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sawltakte</para>
  <para style="mt">Sawltakte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theophilus awng: Ka laibu masa sia sungah Jesus nasep a kipat pan a, kipan a sepna le hilnate theampo kong at zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama vantung ah a kilaakto ni dong, huam hi. A kilaak to ma in, sawltak tu a tealte tungah Thaa Thiangtho vaang taw thupiakna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thi zawk ni sawmli sungah amate tungah tamvei ma kilak a, ama sia nungta nginge ahi hunlam up laak om ngawl tu in, a nanam in kilak hi. Ama sia sawltakte in mu uh a, Pathian Ngam thu ama in sonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate hong kikhoptua uh ciangin, hi bangin thupia hi: “Jerusalem nusia heak vun, no tungah kong sonsa Pa ii kamciam hong piaksa letsong sia, na ngak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />John in tuidam taw tui hong phum hi, ahihang ni tawmvei no sungin, note Thaa Thiangtho taw na ki baptize tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawltakte in Jesus taw a kisik uh ciangin, “Topa awng, Israel mite tungah a Ngam na pia kik tu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesus in, “Hunte le thunei theinate sia ka Pa zeak hi a, bang hun ciang hi tu cisia no heak tu thu hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Thaa Thiangtho note tungah hong pai ciang, vaangletna taw na kidim tu uh a, Jerusalem pan kipan Judea ngam bup le Samaria ngam le leimong dongin, ka tetti na hi tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi teng a ci zawkciang, amate mu tangin, van ah ama kilato a, meeikaai in lia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama ii paina san vantung salh in, a om uh laitakin, puankaang silh pasal nii sia amate kungah hong ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amate in, “Galilee mite awng, van ento in banghangin tua munah ding top nu ziam? Hi Jesus sia note kung pan vantung ah a kilaak to na mu uh bang tatak ma in hong pai kik tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Sawltakte in Jerusalem pan kilometre khat bang a khualana Olive Mual panin, Jerusalem ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate Jerusalem khua sungah tumin, a taam ngeina mun inn tung dawl sungah om uh hi. Amate teng sia Peter, John, James le Andrew, Philip le Thomas, Bartholomew le Matthew, Alphaeus, ii tapa James, Minam it Simon, le James ii tapa Judas ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus ii suapui pate, a nu Mary le numei dangte taw amate pawlkhat, thungen tu in kikhawmtua nithi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni tawmvei zawkciangin, thu um teng kikhopna khat om a, mihing za le kul bang pha uh hi. Tuaciang Peter sia thuson tu in, ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ka suapuite awng, Thaa Thiangtho in David tungtawnin, Jesus a man tute, lam a lak Judas huvau a sonkholna laithiangtho kammalte a taangtut kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judas sia koma ii pawl mi khat ahi hi, banghang ziam cile koma ii nasepna sungah, ama zongh nasep khat nei tu in, a kiteal pa ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Judas in ama ii ngitlo ngamtatna taw a nga sum taw lo khat lei a, tuasung ah pukvawk in thi hi; ama sia puaktham in, a ngil keekeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem ah a teang mihing theampo in tua thu za ahikom, tua lo sia, amate kam in Akeldama, a khiakna sia “Chisan Lo” ci in min phuak uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Banghang ziam cile Psalm late ii sungah, ‘Ama ii bangkua awngthong tahen a, kuama a teang om heak hen,’ ci in ki at a, ‘A nasepna mun zongh midang khat in laih tahen,’ ci in ki at si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Topa Jesus thaw kikna tetti in a pang tu mihing khat kote sungah hong kibelap kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama sia bangbang mihing hi tu ziam cile, John ii tuiphumna huvau a hil hun pan kipan Jesus van ah a kilaak to dong a kilaklaw teng, Jesus khualhawna theampo sung, ko pawl sungah hong kihel top khat ahi kul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in, mihing nii ii min aap uh hi. Barsabbas a kici Joseph (Justus zongh kici si) khat le, Matthias ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in, “Topa awng, mihing theampo ii thinsung na he hi. Tua ahiciang, Topa awng, hite nii sung pan koisia teal ni ziam hong lak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judas in a zot natu zuanin a nusiat sawltak za a awng sia dip natu in hong hesak ta'n” ci in thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin amate in, tua mite nii sung pan, a kiteal natu in, lai aisaan a, Matthias kiteal ahikom, sawltak sawm le khat te ii pawl sungah ama kibelap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pentecost ni hong thet ciangin, thu um theampo mun khat ah kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhat thu in, van pan a nging khat hong om a, vui nasia tak a vak ngawp ciang, a luum himhum bang hi in, amate tona inn buppi sia tua a nging taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin amate in leei taw a kibang meikuang mu uh a, tua munah a om mihing khat sim sia, tua meikuang in thutha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sia Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim uh a, Thaa ii a pausak bangin, kampau dangte taw pau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua laitak leitung theampo pan hong pai biakna kin Jew te Jerusalem khua ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi awnging sia a zaak uh ciangin, mihon khat hong kikhawm uh hi. Amate liinglawng ngawp uh hi. Banghang ziam cile thu umte ii pauna sia, amate tek ii kam taw za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lamdangsakna taw amate in hi bangin ci uh hi. “Tu a bangin a pau mihingte sia Galilee mite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hikasap amate pau sia, eima kam tek taw ih zaak sia bangbang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eite sia Parthia, Media le Elam pan hikale, Mesopotamia, Judea le Cappadocia pan, Pontus le Asia pan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phrygia le Pamphylia pan, Egypt le Cyrene taw a kinai Libya pan, pawlkhat Rome pan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jew le Gentile te Jew biakna a suakte, tuaciang eite pawlkhat sia Crete le Arabia pan — hi napi ih mihing sim in eima kam tek taw Pathian nasep lianpi a sepna ih za tek hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hisia in bang thu ziam?” ci in lamdangsakna le lungdamna taw khat le khat kidongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong pawlkhatte in thu umte sia nunau a, “Hi mihingte in zukham hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Peter in a dang sawltak sawm le khat te taw ding a, mihonte tungah nging takin thuson hi: “Jew minampuite le Jerusalem ah a teang note theampo awng, hong ngai tavun, hisia in bang thu ziam ci sia hong sonsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi lai a, mihingte sia no upmawk bangin, zukham hi ngawl hi. Tu laitak sia zingsang nai kua hi pheang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hi zaw ngawlin, hisia in kamsaangpa Joel ii sonsa thu hi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Hisia in ni tawpkhak sang ciangin ka vawt tu thu ahi hi, Pathian in ci hi: Ka thaa ka buak tu hi. Na tapate le na tanute in, keima thu thangsak tu uh hi. Na khangnote in mang mu tu uh hi; Na khanghaamte in, mang man tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi hi, pate zongh numeite zongh ka naseamte ngawngawn tung zongh ah tua ni ciangin, ka thaa ka buak tu a, tuaciang amate in keima ii thu thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Van ah a lamdang laknate ka vawt tu a, leitung ah a lamdang nate ka piangsak tu hi; chisan, meikuang le meikhu ciikte hong om tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni hong mial a hong zing tu hi. Tha in chi bangin san tu hi. A lian a minthang Topa Ni hong thet ma in, tuabang hong piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, huna ngen a, Topa a biakpui peuma kingum tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hi kammalte ngai vun. Israel mipuite awng! Nazareth mi Jesus sia Pathian in ama tungtawnin a vawt nalamdang laknate le a lamdangte theampo hu in Pathian piak thunei pa tatak ahi hunlam kilangh hi. Noma mama in zongh, hi thu he nu hi, banghang ziam cile hi mun note sungah hi thu piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian in ama thuneina le tupna taw Jesus sia no khut sungah ki aap tu in zeak zo hi; tuaciang mimawte in, ama sia thinglamtee tungah na kilhsakna uh taw note in ama na thatlum zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in ama sia, a thite kawm pan phong kik a, thina vaang panin suaktasak hi, banghang ziam cile, thina in ama thong sungah a khumcip tu sia suak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom, David in ama huvau ah, ‘Topa sia a tawntungin ka mai ah ka mu hi; ama sia ka kungah om ahikom, ngim ka nga buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi thu hangin lungdamna taw ka kidim a, tuaciang ka kammalte in lungdamna taw kidim hi. Tuaciang kei sia a thithei ka hi hangin, muanmawkna sungah, thin muangin ka tawlnga tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />banghang ziam cile, nang in ka thaa sia mithite khua ah nong nusia buatu hi; nang in na naseampa, thaan sungah a muatcip tu in nong oai buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nuntakna lampi nong lak zo a, tuaciang nangma nong ompuina in, lungdamna taw nong kidimsak tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Suapuite awng, a minthang ih taanghpupi David kumpipa thu sia thiangtho takin, ka son kul hi. Ama sia thi in kiphum hi. Ama thaan zongh tuni dongin, eima kungah om nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama sia kamsaang khat hi a, David ii suan sung pan khat sia, David bangma in kumpi khat a suasak natu, Pathian ii kamciam a piaksa ahi hunlam ama in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David in Pathian ii a vawt tu khat mukhol zo ahikom, Messiah thaw kikna thu, hi bangin son hi. ‘Ama sia mithite khua ah kinusia ngawl hi. a pumpi thaan sungah muat ngawl hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathian in hi Jesus mama mithite sung pan phong a, ko theampo in hi thu ah tetti ka pang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama sia Pathianziatsang ah to tu in kiphong a, ama in, a Pa kamciam bangma in, Thaa Thiangtho saang hi. Tuaciangin tu a na mu uh na zaak uh sia, ama letsong kote tungah hong buaksuk sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile vantung ah a kaato pa in David hi ngawl hi, ama in, ‘Topa in ka Topa tungah: Hi sung ka ziatsang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na ngalte na peang nuai ah peang ngakna bangin kong koisak mateng in, hong to ta'n,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Israel mite theampo ii telthiang tu thu in, hi Jesus thinglamtee tungah na kilh uh pa sia, Topa le Messiah tu a, Pathian vawt sa ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua mihingte in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, nasia takin a thin uh ngim a, Peter le sawltak dangte munah, “Suapuite awng, bang law tu khu ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na mawnate uh hong kimaisak a, Pathian ii tel, Thaa Thiangtho na saan natu in, note khat sim in, na mawnate pan kikheal nanak vun a, Jesus min taw tui kiphum tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Pathian kamciam sia, no le na tate le, a khualana ah a omte atu in a kivawt hi a, tuaciangin Topa Pathian ii ama kungah a samsa theampo atu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Peter in amate tungah zolna le hanthotna kammal tam mama zangh a, “Hi mihing seksolte ii thuak tu daan pan suakta tavun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihing tam mama in a thuson um a, tui kiphum uh hi. Tua ni in mihing tulthum bang pawlpi sungah kibelap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in a hun neite uh sia, sawltakte tung pan thusinna in zangh a, kipawlna sung, pawl anneakkhopna le thungetna sungah kihel tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nalamdang laknate le a lamdang tam mamate, sawltakte tungtawnin kivawt a, hi thu hu in mihing theampo in lamdangsakna taw kidim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thu umte theampo in kithawl vadiam in, a neisate khat le khat kihawm in, om suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amate in a neisate zuak a, mihing khat sim ii a kitaangsapna babang taw kizui in, a sum hawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kipawlkhawm in Biakinnpi ah ni sim kikhawm uh a, lungdamna le kiniamkhiakna thin taw inn ah an zongh nekhawm uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian pokin mihing theampo ii diksakna zongh nga uh hi. Topa in ni simin, ngupna nga mihing amate pawl sungah belap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Peter le John sia thunget hun, nitak nai thum in Biakinn ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kongpi Hoi kicina munah a khan tawntung peangzaw pasal khat om hi. Biakinnpi ah a pai mite ii tung pan sum ngen tu in ama sia nisimin tua kongpi hui ah puakin kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peter le John sungtang tu a mu ciangin, bang khat po ama a piak tu in, ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in pasalpa sia a tangtan in salh uh a, Peter in, “Hong en ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate tung pan, na khat pawpo nga tu in, kimuanmawkna taw en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Peter in, “Sum le paai nei ngawl khi hi, ahizong ka nei sia hong pia tu khi hi: Nazareth mi Jesus Christ min taw thoto in lampai in, ci in thu kong pia hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin a khut ziatsang pan len in, dingsak hi. Thakhat thu in, pasalpa peangte le a siakmitte hat hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama sia kilawn in, a peang taw ding a, lampai tu in kipan hi. Tua zawkciangin, amate taw Biakinnpi sungah tum a, lampai in, kilawn in, Pathian pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihon bup in, tuabang kalsuan a, Pathian a pok laitakin, mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kongpi Hoi” kici Biakinn tumna a, khutdaw ngenpa ahi hunlam, a heak uh ciangin, ama tungah thupiang sia lamdang sa mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua pasalpa in Peter le John lenin, a om laitak, tua munah a om mihing theampo in Solomon ii Talaap a kicina mun dong del uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Peter in mipite a mu ciangin, “Israel mipuite awng, banghangin hi tungtaang ah lamdang sa in, ko sia hong salh ngengu nu ziam? Ko ii vaangletna, ahibuale Pathianzia ka neina uh taw, hisia pa lampaisak thei hong sa nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian, ih taanghpupite ii Pathian in, a Naseampa Jesus sia Pathian piak minthanna pia hi. Noma in ama sia Jew lampuite tungah na aap uh hi. Pilate in ama suaktasak tu in, a khensat zawkciang zong, Pilate mai ah na nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama sia thiangtho a, pha hi napi na nial uh a, ama taangin, mihing thatpa khat Pilate ii suatak a piak tu in, na ngen zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hi a, nuntakna a pia pa, note in na thatlum uh hi. Ahitazong, Pathian in ama thina panin, phongto a, hi thu huvau ah, kote in tetti ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama' min ii vaang in hi peangzaw pa thahatna pia hi. Na mu uhte le na heak uhte sia, ama ii min upna taw a kivawt hi; Na mu tek siat uh bangma in Jesus a upna in, ama damsak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tu in ka mipui Israel te awng, note le na lampuite ii, Jesus tungah na ngamtat uhte, tel ngawl vai ahi hunlam hong he khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in nidang lai pekin, kamsaang theampo ii muk panin, Messiah in a thuak kul tu hi, ci in a thu thangsak khol zo hi; tuaciang hi bangin tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahiciang kisiik kik vun a, Pathian kung zuan vun, tua hile na mawnate hong kimaisak tu hi. Tuabang na hi uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa hong ompuina panin, thahatna hong piang tu hi, tuaciangin, no atu a kiteal kholsa Messiah ahi Jesus sia ama in hong paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian kamsaang thiangthote ii khuangei hunlai a, a sonkhol sa bangma in, na theampo a kithaksua siat dong, ama in vantung ah om hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Moses in, ‘Na Topa Pathian in kei hong paisak bangma in, kamsaang khat hong paisak tu a, ama sia noma mite sung pan khat hi tu hi. Ama ii sep tu hong son thu theampo na ni tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in, tua kamsaangpa ci bang a ni ngawl sia Pathian mite sung pan kituam khenin kisusia tu hi’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciangin Samuel le ama zawkciang hong piangte pan kipan, thu son tu a nei kamsaang theampo in tu hun dongin a piang tawto thute son lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kamsaangte tungtawn a, Pathian kamciamte note atu ahi hi. Pathian le na taanghpupite thuciamna a siimte na hi uh hi. Pathian in Abraham tungah, ‘Na suan, na paalte tungtawnin, leitung mihing theampo thupha ka pia tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom note theampo in na ngitlo nate pan kikheal a, thupha hong piak thei natu in, Pathian in a Naseampa teal in note kungah hong sawl masa hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Peter le John mihingte tungah thu a son laitakin, thiampite pawlkhat, biakinn cingte a ukpa le Sadducee te pawlkhat amate kungah theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate lungkim ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile, mithite thaw kik tu thu a kilanghsakna in, Jesus sia thina pan tho kik zo hi, cina thu sawltakte nii in mihingte tung a hil hu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in, sawltakte nii manin, ni niam zo ahikom a zing ciang dong thong sungah khum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang a thuson a za mihing tam mama in um a, thu um mi tulnga bang khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zing ciangin Jew lampuite, upate le Thukham hil syate, Jerusalem ah kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Thiampi Lianbel Annas, Caiaphas, John, Alexander, le Thiampi Lianbel ii innkuanpui dangte taw kimu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in sawltakte sia a mai ah dingsak a, “Hi sia bangbangin seam nu ziam? Note in bang vaang nei a, akua min zangh nu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho taw a kidim Peter in zo a, “Minamte lampui le upate awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />peangzaw pa tungah thupha vawtna le ama a kidamsakna hu in, kote tuni in, thu sit thuak ka hi uh le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />no teng le Israel mi theampo in hi mihingpa sia thinglamtee tung na thalup, Pathian ii thina pan a phok kik Nazareth mi Jesus Christ min taw dam thiang in hi sung note mai ah hong ding ahi hunlam na heak uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus sia laithiangtho in hi bangin a ci pa ahi hi. ‘No inn sate ii na nil uh suang sia, a theampo sung pan a thupibel suang suak hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngupna sia ama bek tungtawnin kinga thei hi; leitung bup ah eite hong ngum thei tu in, Pathian piaksa midang khat zongh om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Council upate in, Peter le John sia mihing thawthong hi a, pilna nei ngawl hi napi, tuza in a hansanna sia lamdang sa uh hi. Tuasia ciangin amate ngeal sia Jesus ii kitholpui ngeite ahi hunlam phawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong amate in bangma a ci thei bua uh hi, banghang ziam cile a kidamsakpa sia, Peter le John taw tua munah dingkhawm in a om mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate Council zum pan pusuak tu in sawl a, tua zawkciang amate sungah, kikum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hi mite bang law tu hi ziam?” ci in amate kidongh uh hi. “Jerusalem a teang mihing sim in, hi a lamdang mama nalamdang lakna amate in vawt uh hi, ci in he siat zo uh a, ih nial thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte sungah, hi thu a kizel ngawl natu in, Jesus min suang a, a pau kikik nawn ngawl natu amate tawngin thupia tawng,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate sam a, sungtangsak kikin, Jesus min taw thu a son ngawl natu, a hil ngawl natu in thupia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Peter le John in zo kik a, “Pathian mai ah — note thu kong nit tu le, Pathian thu ka nit tu uh, koisia maan zaw ziam, noma tek in khensat tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ka mu sa uh, ka zaaksa uh thute son ngawlin, ka om thei buatu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Council te in, nasia seseam in a kidop natu in, tawng a, thu a piak zawkciang suaktasak hi. Amate daan piak tu suak thei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile mi theampo in thupiang sa sia tungtaang ah Pathian pok kim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi nalamdang lakna ahi a kidamsak pa sia kum sawmli vaal pha zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kisuataksak po ciang Peter le John sia a pawlte kungah heak kikin, thiampi liante le upate ii son teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thu umte in a zaak uh ciang, Pathian tungah hi bangin thungen khawm uh hi: “Vantung, leitung le tuipi le a sungah a om theampo ii Topa le Bitphuapa!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho tungtawnin, kote taanghpupi David, na naseampa tungah hi bangin na ci hi. ‘Banghangin Gentile te sia a thin uuk ngawp ziam; banghangin mihingte in a vaal thawthongin vaihawm ku ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitung kumpite in amate le amate kithoai kholin, tuaciangin ukpite kikhawmtua a, Topa le ama ii Messiah langpan uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Herod le Pontius Pilate in hi khuapi ah Gentile te le Israel mite taw kisitua in, a thiangtho na Naseampa Jesus, Messiah tu a, na vawt pa sia langpan takpi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma vaangletna le na deina taw tuabangin piang hen ci a, na khensat sa theampo a taangtun natu in, amate kisitua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu in Topa awng, amate hong tawnnate, na za in a, ko na naseamte in, na thu hangsan tak ka son thei natu in, hong piangsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cidamna a pian natu in, na khut hong vaan ta'n a, nalamdang laknate le, a lamdang vawtte, a thiangtho na Naseampa Jesus min taw a kisep thei natu, hong thukim ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thunget a man uh ciangin amate kikhopna mun sia kingawk hi. Amate sia Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim a, Pathian thu sia hanna taw son tu in kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thu umte pawl sia thinkhat lungkhat in, om uh hi. Kuama in kei aituam neisa hi, a ci om ngawlin, a neisa uh theampo khat le khat kihawm vadiam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sawltakte in Topa Jesus thaw kikna thu, vaangletna lian taw, tetti pang uh a, Pathian in thupha tam mama amate theampo tungah buak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate pawl sungah kitaangsapna a nei kuama a om bua hi. Lo neite le inn neite in, zuakin a nga uh sumte paipui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />sawltakte tungah aap uh hi. Tuaciang, tua sumte mihing sim in, a kisapna uh bangin, hawm tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaciang, Cyprus ah a suak, Levi mi Joseph, sawltakte ii Barnabas a nak pa (a khiakna “hanthawnpa”)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />in, a neisa lo khat zuakin, a sum teng paipui a, sawltakte tungah aap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahihang Ananias min nei mihing khat om a, a zi Sapphira taw a neisa pawlkhat zuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A zi zongh ii thukimpuina taw sum pawlkhat amate atu keam tuam a, a om lai teng sawltakte aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peter in, “Ananias awng, banghangin Satan in na thin uksak a, Thaa Thiangtho theam in, na neisate zuak man sum aheap banghangin keam ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na neisa na zuak ma in, nangma aa ahi hi; tuaciang na zuak zawkciangin, tua sum sia nangma aa ma ahi hi. Tua hikasap banghangin tuabang ngamtat tu khensat ni ziam? Mihingte a theam na hi bua hi — Pathian a theam suak zo ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thu a zaak po ciang, Ananias pukin thi hi; tuaciang tua thu a za theampo lau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khangnote hong tum a, a luang tun in, pusuapui in phum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nai thum bang kihal zawkciangin, bang thu piang ci he ngawlin a zi hong sungtang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Peter in ama munah, “Na neisa na zuak uh sung pan, hi teng sia nang le na pasal ii na nga uh a buppi ma ahi nam, hong son ta'n,” ci hi. “Hi hi, a buppi ma hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Peter in ama tungah, “Banghangin nang le na pasal in, Topa ii Thaa sia ze et nu ziam? Na pasal a phumte sia tu laitakin, kongbiang ah om hi, nangma zongh amate in hong pua tu a, hong pusuapui tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thakhat thu in ama sia Peter peang ah puk in thi hi. Khangnote sungtang a, ama sia a thisa in mu uh hi, tua ahikom amate in doipua ah pusua in, a pasal hui ah phum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawlpi bup le hi thu a za mihing theampo lau mama tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sawltakte in mihingte sungah nalamdang laknate le a lamdangte tam mama vawt uh hi. Thu um theampo Solomon Talaap ah kisitua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihingte in amate sia phat son mama napi a puasang mi kuama in a pawm ngam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang mihing tam vaial amate pawl sungah kibelap a — Topa a um pa le numei honkhat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sawltakte nasepna hangin, lampite tungah ciinate hong kipua a, Peter hong pai ciang ciinate pawlkhat tungah ama ii limh beak ii a liap thei natu dei in, lupnate tung le phahte tungah sialin lampi hui ah lumsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang in Jerusalem kiim khuate pan mihonpite hong pai in, ciinate le doaiveite paipui uh hi; tuaciang amate theampo kidamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbelpa le a pawl a lawm theampo, le tua mun a om Sadducee pawlte in sawltakte sia nasia takin eang uh hi; tua ahikom thu vawt tu in khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in sawltakte manin, nautaangte kikhumna thong sungah khum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang tua zanin Topa vantunglalang khat in thong kongkha hon a, sawltakte a pusuasak zawkciangin, amate tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pai tavun a, Biakinn sungah dingin, hi nuntakna thak thu, mihingte tungah son tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sawltakte in, a sawl bangin ni a, khuavak ciangin Biakinnpi sungah tumin, hilcianna nei tu in kipan uh hi. Thiampi Lianbelpa le a pawl a lawmte in Jew lampuite theampo Council bup kikhopna ah kikhawm tu in sam uh hi; tua zawkciangin sawltakte amate mai ah a paipui natu in thonginn ah thupia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang thong ukte thonginn a thet uh ciangin, sawltakte thong sungah a mu bua uh hi, tua ahikom Council zum ah heak kikin a thu bang teng son a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thonginn ka thet uh ciangin, thong kongkhate kikalh bikbek in om a, kongkhacing theampo zongh thong kongcing in ka mu uh hi; ahihang kongkha ka hon uh ciang, a sungah kuama ka mu bua uh hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Biakinn cingte ukpa le thiampi liante in, hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, sawltakte bang tat hi tu ziam, ci in lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuasia ciang pasal khat hong sungtang a, amate munah, “Ngai vun! Thong sung a na khum uhte in mihonte hilcian in, Biakinnpi sungah om uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom Biakinn cing ukpa sia, a khutnuai mihingte taw pai in, sawltakte paipui kik uh hi. Amate in mihingte ii suangtum taw a den tu lau ahikom, sawltakte tungah zawthawk thu a zangh ngam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sawltakte sungtan pui uh a, Council te mai ah, dingsakin, Thiampi Lianbelpa in thusit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hisia pa min taw thu hilcian thei nawn ngawl tu nu hi, ci in nasia takin thu kong pia zo uh hi; ahihang tu in bang vawt kik nu ziam! Jerusalem khuathing ah, na thu hilcianna uh kizelsak zo a, ama thina thu kote maw hong pusak nuam nu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Peter le sawltak dangte in zo kik a, “Pathian thu ka nit tu uh hi a, mihingte thu ka nit tu uh hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Note in Jesus thinglamtee tungah kilh in, na thalup zawk uh ciang, ka taanghpupite ii Pathian in Jesus thina panin phong kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel mite a mawna uh panin, kisiik kik a, mawmaisakna a nga natu hunpha pia tu in, Pathian in ama thosak kik a, a ziatsang ah koi in Lampuipa le Hunpa suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama thu a nite tungah a piak letsong ahi, Thaa Thiangtho le kote in hi thu huvau ah tetti ka hi uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Council upate sung a kihelte in, hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, a thin uh uuk mama a, sawltakte thatlum nuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang amate sung panin Phariseete Gamaliel kici Thukham hil syapa khat ahi ngual theampo ii zatak pa sia Council sungah hong ding hi. Ama in sawltakte tawmvei a pusuasak natu in thupia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuaciang Council te tungah, “Israel mipuite awng, hi mite tungah na vawt tu uh kidawm tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu nung hiat in, Theudas kici khat hong piang a, ama le ama sia a nasia mama mi khat in kison a, tuaciang pasal zali bang in ama pawm uh hi. Ahihang ama sia kithat a, a nungzuite kithethaang in, a vai teng a bona thu na he nginge uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hisia zawkciangin, Galilee mi Judas kici khat mihing simna a kivawt hun lai in, hong piang hi; ama zongh nungzui mihonpi khat nei a, ahihang ama zongh kithatlum in, a nungzuite sia kithethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi thu tungtaang ah, hi mite bangma law heak vun kong ci hi. Amate nguak koi nginge po vun! Banghang ziam cile amate ngealna le sepna in, mihing sepna ahile hong bo tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />ahihang tuate in Pathian kung pan hong pai ahile, zo zo ngawl tu nu hi. Noma le noma Pathian langpan a, a do kisua tu nu hi!” ci hi. Council in Gamaliel ii ngaisut piakna zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sawltakte sungtang in sawl a, vel in, Jesus min taw a hil nawn ngawl natu thupia hi; tua zawkciang amate tha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Sawltakte in Council a nusiat ciang, Jesus atu in maizum thuak tu, Pathian in kiphu sa ahikom lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaciang ni simin Biakinnpi sung le ngual innte ah Jesus Messiah ii Lungdamna Thupha hilcianna le thuhilna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawk hun khat ciangin, a nungzuite khakhang a, Greek kampau Jew te le innteak Jew te kilaklaw ah kihau na khat piang hi. Greek kampau Jew te in ni sim sum a kihawm ciangin, amate ii meingongte sia, kingaingon hi, ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom sawltak sawm le niite in, nungzui theampo khawmtua a, “Ko sia sum vai taw komlaak hu in, Pathian kammal taw thuhilna, ka ngaingon tu uh sia maan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, suapuite awng, Thaa Thiangtho le ciimna taw a kidim hi ci in a kitel pasal sali noma sung pan hong teal tavun a, amate khut sungah, hi nasep sia ih aap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ko ka hi uh le tuasia ciangin ka hun uh a bit in thungetna le thuhilna in, ka zangh tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawl buppi ma in sawltakte ii ngaisut piakna bangin, lungkim uh ahikom, amate in, Thaa Thiangtho le upna taw a kidim Stephen, Philip, Prochorus, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas, le Nicolaus a kici Antioch khua pan, Jew biakna ah tu mahiat in a kikheal Gentile mi khat teal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua pawlte in tua mite teng sia sawltakte tungah aap uh a, sawltakte in amate lu tungah a khut nga in thungetsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabangin Pathian kammal hong kizel to hi. Jerusalem khua ah a nungzuite khang vaial a, thiampi tam mamate in hi upna saang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ii a thupha nasia takin a piak, vaangletna taw a kidim Stephen in, nalamdangte le a lamdangte tam mama mipite sungah vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang pasal pawlkhat in langpan uh a, tua mite sia A Kisuatak Mite ii synagogue sungah pawlmite hi a, Cyrene pan le, Alexandria pan Jew te kihel hi. Amate sia Cilicia ngamkhen le Asia ngamkhen te pan Jew dangte taw kikopin, Stephen taw kam kinial hong kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Thaa in Stephen sia tuabang ciimna pia ahikom ama a pau ciangin a nalh zo bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate in, pasal pawlkhat sumnguk pia a, “Moses le Pathian langpan in, a pauna za khu hi!” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bang danin mihonte, upate le Thukham hil syate hol uh hi. Amate in Stephen manin Council mai ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, leilot tetti pang tu in, mihing pawlkhat sungtangsak hi. Amate in, “Hisia pa in, a thiangtho ih Biakinnpi le Moses Thukham sia langpan tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nazareth mi Jesus in, hi Biakinnpi sutham tu a, Moses tung pan hong paisuk ih ngeina theampo hong khealsak tu hi, ci in a son laitakin za khu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Council sungah a to te theampo in, Stephen en tek uh a, a maitang sia vantunglalang maitang taw kibangin mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbelpa in Stephen munah, “Hi thu a maan ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Stephen in zo kik a, “Suapuite le pate awng, hong ngai tavun! Ih taanghpupi Abraham sia Haran ah teang tu in, a pai ma, Mesopotamia ah a ten laitakin, ama tungah vaanglian Pathian kilak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Na innkuanpuite le na ngam nusia in, kong lak tu ngam ah va pai ta'n,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom a ngam nusia in, Haran ah pai hi. Abraham ii pa a thi zawkciang, tu laitak note teenna hi ngam ah Pathian in kikhiinsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua laitak hunin Pathian in, Abraham aituam neisa tu in, leitangh metre khat kiimhuam zongh a pia bua lai hi, ahihang Pathian in piak tu in, kamciam pia hi, ama nung pan a suan a paalte atu zongh ahi hi. Pathian ii hi kamciam a piak hunin, Abraham in ta a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian kamciam in hi bang ahi hi: ‘Na suan na paalte sia, ngamdang ah peam tu a, amate sila suakin kum zali tawntung kivawtsia cip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang a silate tungah a kilawm thukhenna ka tungsak tu a, tua zawkciangin amate tua ngam panin pusuak in, hi sungah amate in kei hong bia tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciangin Pathian in, Abraham sia thuciamna ii lim tu in vunteap atsakna zeksa pia hi. Tua ahikom Abraham in, Isaac sua zawk nipi khat a cin ciangin, a vunteap atsak hi, Isaac in a tapa Jacob a vunteap atsak hi; Jacob in a minthang ih taanghpupite sawm le niite ii vunteap atsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Jacob tate in a suapui Joseph sia eang uh a, Egypt ah sila in na zuak uh hi. Ahihang ama taw Pathian omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciangin a ngim ngana theampo pan suatak pia hi. Egypt kumpipa mai ah, Joseph a kilak ciang, Pathian in thuzawkhuaina le ciimna pia a, tuaciang kumpipa in Joseph sia ngamuk mangpa le kumpi bangkua a uk suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Egypt le Canaan ngam bup ah kialpi tung a, ngimna nasia takin piang hi. Ih taanghpupite in anneak tu nei ngawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuasia ciang Jacob in Egypt ngam ah antang om hi, ci in a zaak ciang, ama in ih taanghpupite ahi a tate sia tuak ah a khat veina in paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nii veina a pai ciang Joseph in ama le ama a suapuite munah kison a, tuasia ciang, Egypt kumpipa in Joseph innkuanpuite huvau he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Joseph in, a pa Jacob tungah thupuaksak a, ama le a innkuan bup, a vekpi a kingawm mihing sawmsali le nga teng sia Egypt ngam ah a pai natu in zasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciangin Jacob sia Egypt ngam ah pai a, tua munah ama le a tate thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A luanghawmte sia Shechem ah kitua hi. Abraham ii Hamor minamte tung pan a sum taw a lei, tuak a thaan sia sungah amate kiphum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Abraham tungah Pathian ii kamciam teng, a tunsak tu ciangin, Egypt ngam ah ih minamte sia nasia tak khangto zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khakbel ciangin, Joseph a he ngawl kumpi khat sia Egypt ngam uk tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in ih taanghpupite theambawl in, ngitlona taw a nausente a thi tu in daaipua ah a vawk natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi hun sia Moses ii pian hun hi a, ama in a mealhoi mama patang khat ahi hi. Ama sia inn ah tha thum kikeam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />inn panin a hep uh ciangin, kumpipa ii tanu in, ama sung pan a piang ta bangin vawt a, vaak in taa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Egypt te ciimna theampo kisinsak a, mihing thupi khat ii kampau luheakzia hong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Moses sia kum sawmli a phak ciangin, a minampui Israel te bangbangin kivawt ziam ci in kan tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt mite khat in a minampui Israel te khat a vawtsia zazaan sia ama in mu hi, tua ahikom hun tu in pai a, Egypt pa thatlum in phulam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(Ama ngaisutna ah, a minampuite suatak natu in, Pathian in ama zangh tu hi ci in a mite in tel tu in um a, ahihang amate in a tel bua uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A zing ciangin Israel te nii, kihau in om mu a, ama in lemtua tu in hanciampui hi. ‘Hong ngai tavun, note unau khat na hi uh hi; banghangin khat le khat kihau nu ziam?’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lawmpa a vawtsia sia pa in, Moses sawn a, ‘Akua in nang sia ko hong uk tu le ko tungah, thukhen tu in hong koi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zeini a Egypt te khat na thalup bangin, kei hong thatlum nuam ni ziam,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in hi thu a zaak ciangin, Egypt ngam pan tai a, Midian ngam ah teang hi. Tua munah tapa nii nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Kum sawmli hong kan zawkciangin Sinai mualhui sennealngam sung sawlpaang kuang khat sungah vantunglalang khat Moses mai ah hong kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses in a mu teng lamdang sa in, a kitel zaw in a mu thei natu sawlpaang sang neak hi. Ahihang Topa ii aw hi bangin za hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Kei sia na taanghpupi Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian ka hi hi’ ci hi. Moses lau in liing ngawp a, en ngam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah, ‘Na peangdap suut in, banghang ziam cile na dinna mun sia thiangtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka minamte Egypt ngam ah vawtsiat a thuakna teng ka mu zo hi. Amate tauna ka za a, amate suatak tu in kong paisuk zo hi. Tu in hong pai ta'n; Egypt ngam ah hong paisak tu khi hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Moses sia Israel te ii a nial pa ahi hi. ‘Akua in nang sia, ko hong uk tu le ko tungah thukhen tu in, hong koi ziam?’ ci in dongh uh hi. Sawlpaang kuang sung pan ama tungah a kilak vantunglalang ii huna taw, Pathian in amate a uk tu le a suaktasak tu in ukpa le hunpa tu in, a thataak pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in Israel te sia Egypt ngam pan pusua pui a, Egypt ngam le San Tuipi ah ahizong, kum sawmli sung sennealngam sungah ahizong, nalamdang laknate le a lamdangte ama in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israel te tungah, ‘Pathian ii kei hong thataak bangma in, Pathian in note atu kamsaang khat hong paisak tu hi,’ tua pa in noma mi pui khat hi tu hi’ a ci pa sia Moses ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sennealngam ah a kikhawmtua Israel mite taw a omkhawm pa sia Moses ahi hi; Sinai mual tungah ama a paupui vantunglalang sia le ih taanghpupite taw tua munah omkhawm a, ei tungah hong piak sawn tu, Pathian ii a nungta thute ama in saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Ahihang ih taanghpupite in ama thu a ni nuam bua uh hi; amate in Moses puavawk in, Egypt ngam ah heak kik thei le uuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahikom Aaron munah, ‘Eite hong lampui tu in milim pathian pawlkhat hong vawtsak ta'n. Egypt ngam pan hong pusua Moses sia bang tawk hi tu ziam he bua hing,’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin, amate in khuital khat ii lim taw a kibang milim khat vawt a, sangaw biakpiakna nei in, amate vawttawm vangiat khat sia upat piakna in poaikhaam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in amate nungngat in, kamsaangte laibu sungah, a om bangma in, van a aksite bia tu in thazau hi: ‘Israel mite awng! Kum sawmli tawntung sennealngam sungah, sa na ngo uh a, nganhing taw biakpiakna, na vawt uhte sia, kei tungah hong vawt na hi bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na puak uh sia Molech pathian ii tuipuan buk le noma ii aksi pathian Rephan lim ahi hi. Tuate in noma ii na biak tu in, na vawttawm uh milimte ahi hi. Tua ahikom Babylon kalh ah sal in kong puak tu hi,’ kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Ih taanghpupite in Pathian ompuina a kilakna Puanbuk sia sennealngam sungah keng kawkoai hi. Tua Puanbuk sia Moses tungah Pathian sawl bang le a kilak lim bangin a kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A khaksang ciangin tua tuipuanbuk a lua, ih taanghpupite in amate mai ah, Pathian ii hawlkeak minamte ii ngam a suan tu in, Joshua taw a pai uh ciangin, tua tuipuan buk sia keng uh hi. David khan hun dong, tua munah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ama in Pathian maipha nga a, Jacob ii Pathian inn tu khat a sak thei natu in Pathian tungah ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian inn tu a sa pa sia Solomon ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />“Ahihang a saangbel Pathian sia mihingte sak inn sungah a teang bua hi; kamsaangpa ci bangma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />‘Vantung in ka kumpi tokhum hi, Topa in ci hi, tuaciangin leitung sia ka peang ngakna ahi hi. Bangbang innte, kei atu hong saksak tu ni ziam? kei teen natu mun sia koisung ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hite theampo keima vawtsa hi ngawl ziam?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Stephen in, “Note bangza in thinpui nu ziam! Bangza in note thin in Pathian he ngawl ziam? Pathian kammal na zaak ngawl natu in, bangza in nangong nu ziam! Na taanghpupite bang lian hi nu hi: note zongh in Thaa Thiangtho nalh tawntung nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na taanghpupite ii a vawtsiat ngawl kamsaang khat beak om ngei kana ziam? Khuangei pek panin, Pathian ii a thutang Naseampa hong pai natu a sonkhol, Pathian kamtaite na thatlum uh hi. Tu in, note in ama leeheak a, suamlum nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Vantunglalangte hong piak Pathian ii thukham a saangte na hi uh hi — ahihang tua thukhamte ni ngawl nu hi!” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Council sung a kihelte in, Stephen thuson a ngai uh ciangin, amate in thin uukna taw a ha ngoai san uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahihang Stephen sia Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim a, vantung ento in, Pathian ii minthanna le Pathianziatsang ah a ding Jesus mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“En vun! Vantung kihong mu khi hi, tuaciang Mihing Tapa sia Pathianziatsang ah, dingin om hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Council sung kihel mihingte in nging takin au a, a khut taw a bil uh hum hi. Tua zawkciang amate teng in, thakhatin ama del uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />khuapi pua ah lawn in, suangtum taw deang uh hi. Tua tetti te in amate puantualte sia, Saul kici tangval khat ii kep tu in, aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amate in Stephen sia, suang taw a hawhua laitakin, ama in Topa biakpui a, “Topa Jesus awng, ka thaa hong saang ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ama in khupdin a, awnging tak taw, “Topa! hi mite mawna na tepteesak heak in!” a ci zawkciangin thi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Stephen a thalupna sia Saul in lungkimpui hi. Tua ni mama in Jerusalem a om pawlpi sia vawtsiatna nasia takin thuak tu kipan hi. Sawltakte simngawl thu um dangte theampo sia Judea le Samaria ngamkhente sungah kithethaang siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu umte pawlkhat in Stephen phum uh a, hee in awnging tak taw ama kaa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Saul ahile Pawlpi sukthap natu hanciam hi; inn khat pan inn khat ah pai in, thu umte kaikeak a, pate zongh numeite zongh thonginn sung denna in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kithethaang thu umte in mun theampo ah pai in thuhil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Philip in Samaria khuapi ah pai in tua mun mipite tungah Messiah ii thu hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihonpite in Philip ii thuson ngai a, nalamdang lakna a vawtte a mu uh ciang ama neakin pha tak ngai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing tam mamate sung pan doai ngilote sia a nging in au a, pusuak hi; pumzawte, peangbaite tam mama dam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua khuapi sungah lungdamna lian om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua khuapi ah Simon min nei pasal khat om a, tawmvei hun sung tengin Samaria te sia ama ii mitbum lakna taw lamdang sasak hi. Ama sia mi thupi khat in ama le ama kison a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang khuapi sungah om theampo kidoidanna om ngawlin, ama thu ngai uh hi. “Ama in ‘Vaangletna Lianpi’ a kici tua Pathian ii vaang sia ahi hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuangei mama sung ama ii mitbum taw lamdang sasak ahikom, a thusonte pha takin ngai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian Ngam lungdamna thupha le Jesus thu Philip ii sonna a up ciangin, pate zongh numeite zongh tui kiphum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Simon mama zongh in um hi; tui a kiphum zawkciang Philip nai ah om top a, a nasia a lamdangte le nalamdang laknate a kivawt a mu ciangin lamdang sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem a om sawltakte in, Samaria a mihingte ii Pathian kammal a saan uh sia za ahikom amate in Peter le John sia tua mite kungah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate hong thet uh ciang, Thaa Thiangtho a nga thei natu in, thu umte atu thungetsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Thaa Thiangtho sia amate khat ii tung zongh ah tuaksuk ngawl lai hi; amate sia Topa Jesus min taw a ki baptize hi bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Peter le John in, amate tungah a khut uh nga a, tuasia ciangin Thaa Thiangtho nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate tungah sawltakte a khut a ngak uh ciangin, thu um mite tungah Thaa Thiangtho a kipiak sia Simon in mu hi. Tua ahikom Peter le John tungah sum pia in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka khut ka ngakna pawpo tungah Thaa Thiangtho a nga natu in, hi vaangletna sia kei zongh hong pia tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Peter in zo kik a, “Pathian letsong sia sum taw kilei thei tu in na up hu in, nang le na sum teng sia hell ah pai tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang in kote nasepna taw kisai nawn ngawl ni hi, banghang ziam cile, Pathian muna ah na thin maan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua hi a, hi a sia na ngealna panin kisiik kik ta'n a, tuaciang tuabang ngaisutna na nei hu in, hong maisak natu in Topa tungah thungen ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile nang sia ngual eenna thin taw a kidim mawna sungah, koltaang pa hi, ci in kong mu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simon in Peter le John tungah, “Tu a nong ci teng kei tungah hong tun ngawl natu, nong hesuakna in Topa tungah thu hong ngetsak tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in tetti pangin Topa thute a thansak zawkciangin, Peter le John te Jerusalem khua ah cia kik uh hi. A cia lam in, Samaria ngam khuano tam mamate ah Lungdamna Thupha hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa vantunglalang khat in, Philip munah, “Kithoai in a, thangsang zuanin Jerusalem pan Gaza paina lampi zui in va pai ta'n,” ci hi. (Hi lampi sia kizangh nawn ngawl hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom Philip in kithoai in pai hi. Tu in Ethiopia kumpinu ii sum kholna a uk cil kinget Ethiopia mi a thupi ulian khat sia a inn ah cia tu in pai hi. Ama sia Jerusalem ah Pathian bia tu in a theng hi a, a siphu ngalleang taw cia kik hi. Tuabangin a cia kawmin, Isaiah thubu sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho in Philip munah “Va pai ta'n a, tua leang taw a kinai in va om ta'n” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Philip in del a, a phak ciangin, ama in kamsaangpa Isaiah thubu a sim sia za hi. “Na sisim teng na tel ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ulian pa in “Hong thiangson khat a om buale bangbangin tel tu khi ziam?” ci in zo kik hi. Leang tungah Philip kaato tu in sam a, amate tokhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A sim laithiangtho mun sia hi bang ahi hi: “Ama in ngawlup tu in a kikai tuu khat taw kibang hi, ama in a mul a kimeetsak ciangin, a haam ngawl tuuno taw kibang hi. Kam khat zongh a pau bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama sia kizawnsak vawt a, thukhaikim thu kitaansak hi. Ama ii suan le paalte huvau sia kuama in a son thei buatu hi, banghang ziam cile, ama ii leitung nuntakna bo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ulianpa in, Philip munah “Kamsaangpa pauna hisia akua a cinopna ziam hong son tan? Ama le ama kici nuam ziam maw midang khat ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaciang Philip in son tu in kipan hi; hi Lai Thiangtho kammal pan panto in, Jesus ii Lungdamna Thupha son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuabangin a pai susuk ciangin tui omna mun khat theng hi, tuaciang Ulianpa in, “Hi sungah tui om hi. Tui ka kiphum natu in bang in hong khak ziam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Philip in ama tungah “Na thin theampo taw na um le, tui kiphum thei tu ni hi,” ci hi. Ama in “Um khi hi. Jesus Christ sia Pathian Tapa hi, ci in um khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ulianpa in a leang a tawlngak natu thupia a, amate nii tui sungah tuaksuk in, Philip in ama tuiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tui sung pan hong kaato uh ciangin, Topa Thaa in Philip la hi. Ulianpa in ama mu kik nawn ngawl ahihang, lungdamna taw kidim in, a pai ngei in paisuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Philip sia Azotus khua ah theng ahi hunlam ama le ama kitel hi; ama Caesarea ah pai suak a, lamdung khua theampo ah Lungdamna Thupha hil hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitak Saul in Topa nungzuite suamlup tu in nasia takin tawng tawntung hi. Thiampi Lianbelpa kungah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa Lampi a zui pate le numeite a mu peuma man khawmin Jerusalem ah a ciapui thei natu, Damascus khua synagogue ukte a lak tu ama thu a kisonna lai ama in ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Damascus ah a pai lam in, khuapi a thet dektak ciang, thakhat thu in van pan a taang khat in, ama kiimkot theampo taan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama lei ah puk a, tuaciang aw khat hi bangin za hi. “Saul! Saul awng! banghangin kei hong vawtsia ni ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Akua ni ziam Topa?” ci in dongh hi. “Kei sia nong vawtsiat pa Jesus ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ahihang, tho in a, khuapi sungah va pai ta'n, Tualai ah na vawt tu a kul teng hong kison tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul taw khual a haw khawmte in, kam khat zongh pau ngawlin, ding uh hi; amate in awnging za ahihang, kuama a mu bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul sia lei panin thoto a, a mit hak ahihang bangma a mu thei bua hi. Tua ahikom amate in, a khut pan len in, Damascus khua sung zotpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni thum sung ama in khua a mu thei bua a, tua hun sung teng in, ama in an hikale tui hikale neak a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Damascus ah Ananias kici Tapidaw khat om hi. Ama in mukholna nei a, Topa in ama munah, “Ananias awng!” ci in biakpui hi. “Hi sungah om ing, Topa” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ama munah, “Lampi Tang kicina munah, pai tu in kithoai in a, tuaciangin Judas inn ah Tarsus khua mi Saul kici khat va kan ta'n. Ama sia tu laitakin thunget saan hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaciangin ama mukholna sungah Ananias kici pasal khat hong pai a, khua a mu thei kik natu in, ama tungah a khut ngak sia mu zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ananias in zo kik a, “Topa awng, mihing tam ma in, hisia pa thu hong son a, Jerusalem ah na mite tungah a cizat huai ama ngamtatna theampo hong kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang hong biate theampo a mat thei natu in, thiampi liante tung pan, thu ngana taw, Damascus khua ah hong pai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in ama munah, “Va pai ta'n, banghang ziam cile, ama sia Gentile te sung, kumpite sung le Israel mite sungah, ka min hong kiheak natu in, ka naseam tu in, ka teal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang keima mama in kei ii hu a, a thuak tu theampo zongh ka lak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ananias pai a, Saul tunna inn sungah tum in, a tungah a khut nga hi. “Suapui Saul awng, hi sungah nong pai lai in, lampi ah nang tungah hong kilak — ih Topa Jesus in, khua na mu thei kik natu le Thaa Thiangtho taw na kidim natu in nang kungah kei hong paisak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thakhat thu in ngasa hawlip taw a kibang pawlkhat sia, Saul mittangte panin, hong taaksuk a, ama in khuamu thei kik hi. Ama ding a tui kiphum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciangin, an a neak zawkciang, a tha hat kik hi. Saul sia Damascus ah thu umte taw ni tawmvei sung om tu in taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in Jew te ii synagogue ah paisuak a, Jesus sia Pathian Tapa hi ci in thuhil tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zate theampo in lamdang sa in, “Jerusalem ah Jesus a biate a thatlum bul sia ama hi kana ngawl ziam? Tuaciangin hi lai hong paina thu zongh, thu umte man a, thiampi liante kungah ciapui tu, ngiimna taw hong pai hi ngawl ziam,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Saul thuhilna in vaang nei vaial a, Jesus sia Messiah hi ci a, a sonthiangna sia, up huai mama ahikom, Damascus khua ah a teang Jew te in, ama a nial thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni tam mama hong kan zawkciang, Jew te kikhawmtua a, Saul sia thalup sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang amate sawmnate, ama tungah kison hi. Ama a thalup thei natu in, sun taw zan taw khuapi kongpite, encik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang zan khat ciangin, a nungzuite in, Saul sia khuapi luphung vang khat pan bawm khat taw in khiasuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul sia Jerusalem ah pai in, nungzuite pawl sungah tum sawm hi. Ahihang amate in, Saul sia nungzui khat hi, ci in um thei ngawl a kiita uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang Barnabas in ama panpui a, sawltakte kungah paipui hi. Saul in lampi tungah Topa taw a kimuna thu le, Topa ii ama a paupuina thu teng zongh son hi. Damascus ah hang takin Jesus min taw thu a hil zongh son si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom Saul sia amate kungah taam a, Jerusalem khuathing bup ah vak kawkoai in, Topa min taw hang takin thuhil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in Greek kampau Jew te taw zongh, kam kikum in kinialna nei a, ahihang Saul sia amate in thasawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thu umte in hi thu a phaw uh ciang, Saul sia Caesaria ah paipui a Tarsus khua ah puak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuabangin Judea ngam Samaria ngam le Galilee ngam bup ah pawlpite in ngammuang takin om theina hun khat nga hi. Pawlpi sia Topa min thasiana taw a nuntak bangma in Thaa Thiangtho huna tungtawnin, thakho in pawlpi mi khangto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Peter sia mun theampo ah khualhaw a, khatvei sia Lydda ah a teang Pathian mite kungah haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua munah Aeneas a kici pasal khat taw kimu a, tua pa sia kum liat tawntung a pumzaw ahikom a tho thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Peter in “Aeneas awng, Jesus Christ in hong damsak hi. Tho in a, na lupna zial in,” ci hi. Tha khat thu in, Aeneas tho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lydda khua le Sharon khua a teang mihing theampo in, ama mu uh a, Topa kungah kiheak siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Joppa khua ah Tabitha kici numei khat om a, ama sia thu um khat ahi hi. (Ama ii Greek min sia Dorcas hi a, “sangai khat” cinopna hi) Ama in a hun nei theampo thupha vawtna le, a zawngte huna in zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin ama, a ciina in thi hi. A luang sia kibual a, inn tung doituam khat sungah sial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Joppa sia Lydda panin a khuala bua hi, tuaciangin thu umte in, Peter sia Lydda khua ah om hi ci in a zaak uh ciangin kamtai nii paisak a, “A manlang in hong pai ta'n,” cisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahikom Peter kithoai in a samte taw ton hi. Ama a thet ciangin, inn tung doituam sungah paipui a, nupi meingong theampo in bawm hon a, kap kawmin, Dorcas a nuntak lai a, a vawt laktongte le laktong puasilhte theampo lak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Peter in amate theampo inn doituam pua sangah pusuaksak a, khupdin in thungen hi; tuaciang mithi luang maingat in, “Tabitha awng, tho in!” ci hi. Numei in a mit hak a, Peter a mu ciang, hong to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Peter in a khut thaak a, ama dingsak hi. Tua zawkciang thu um theampo sam a, meingongte zongh kihel in, amate tungah, numei sia a nungta in aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hi thupiang sia Joppa khuazaang ah thang a, mihing tam mama in, Topa um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Peter sia Joppa ah savun vawt ahi Simon kungah ni tam mama taam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Caesarea khua ah Rome kumpite ngalkap ahi “Italy Ngalkapte” kici ngalkap honkhat sungah ngalkap bu a seam Cornelius kici khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama sia biakna kin khat hi; ama le a innkuan bupin Pathian bia uh hi. Ama in Jew mizawngte a hu thei za in hu a, tuaciang tatsat ngawlin Pathian tungah thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni khat nitak nai thum bang hun mahiat in, ama in mang mu a, hi sitset in a muna ah Pathian vantunglalang khat in, “Cornelius awng!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in launa taw vangtunglalang sia salh a, “Topa awng, bang ziam?” ci hi. Vantunglalang in, “Pathian in na thungetna le, a zawngte na hunate hangin lungdam a, na thunget na te uh hong zo tu kithoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in mihing pawlkhat Joppa ah paisakin, Simon Peter kici mihing pa samsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama sia tuipi hui ah a teang savun vawt Simon inn ah zintung hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, vantunglalang in paisan hi, tuaciang Cornelius in a inn sung a naseamte nii le biakna a kin, ama aituam a cing ngalkap khat sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupiang teng amate tungah son in Joppa ah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zing ciangin, amate Joppa khua nai a thet laitak Peter in thungen tu in sun hun laitakinnkhum tungah kaato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a ngilkial ahikom an ne nuam zo hi; tuabangin an neak tu a kivawt saan laitak ama in mukholna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van kihongin mu a, bang ziam maw puanzapui bang khat, king li panin kikhai in lei ah kikhiasuk khat mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sungah nganhing namcin le awmtaal a, a vak theite le ngam vacimte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw khat in ama munah, “Peter awng tho in; hite ngo lum in a, ne in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Peter in, “Ne mama bua tong, Topa awng! Biakna taw kisai, a thiang ngawlin a kikoite le nin hi a kici sate ne ngawl het tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua aw taw ma in paupui kik a, “Pathian ii thiansak sate a nin in ngaisun heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hisia thumvei vaset a kici zawkciangin, van ah kila to kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peter in a mukholna sia huvau ii khiakna lungmangin a om laitakin, Cornelius sawltakte in Simon inn mu uh a, kongbiang ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hi sungah, Simon Peter a kici zin khat hong tung ziam,” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Peter in a mukholna sia ii khiakna bangbang peuma ahi katawm, ci in tel tu in a hanciam laitak Thaa in, “Ngai in! hi lai ah pasal thum in nang hong zon saan laitak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom kithoai in a, tuaksuk in. Tuaciangin amate taw kithawl tu nakna heak in, banghang ziam cile amate in keima sawl ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom Peter tuaksuk a, pasalte munah, “Na zon uh sia keima khi hi. Bang vai a hong pai nu ziam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ngalkap bu Cornelius in kote hong sawl hi,” ci hi. “Ama sia Pathian a bia mihing pha khat hi a, Jew te theampo in zakta uh hi. Pathian vantunglalang khat in, ama tungah na son tu thute a zaak thei tu in nang hong sap tu in sawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Peter in amate sungtang tu in sam a, zan khat ngiaksak hi. A zing ciang kithoai in amate taw ding uh hi; tuaciangin Joppa pan nungzui pawlkhat taw zong, paikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A zing ciangin, Caesarea khua theng uh a, tua munah ama ii a sam mealheakte le a muan a ngualtamhte taw Cornelius in ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Peter sia inn sung tum tu a kithoai ciangin Cornelius in muak a, a peang ah bokin ama mai ah a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Peter in dingsak hi. Ama in, “Ding in, keima sia mihing khat ma hi lel khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Peter sia Cornelius taw thuson kawmin, inn sungah a tum ciangin, mihing tam mama kikhawm mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate tungah, “Na heak tek uh hi a, Jew te khat sia Gentile te khat ii inn ah a haw tu ahizong, kithawl tu ahizong a biakna in oai ngawl hi. Ahihang Pathian in mihing khat pawpo biakna taw kisai in, thiang ngawl hi, nin hi, ka ci ngawl het natu in hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom nong samsak uh ciangin nial ngawlin kong pai hi. Tua ahiciang nong sapna thu sia banghang ziam ci in kong dongh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cornelius in, “Tu nung ni thum lai tubang hun nitak nai thum hun khawngin ka inn ah thu ka ngen hi. Thakhat thu in a tee vakil puan a silh pasal khat ka mai ah hong ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Cornelius awng! Pathian in na thungetna hong za a, ngual na hu thongna teng hong musak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat Joppa ah paisak in a, a min tatak Simon Peter kici, pasal khat sia samsak ta'n. Ama sia tuipi hui a teang savun vawt pa Simon kici khat ii inn ah tung hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahikom thakhatin kong samsak a, na dikna hangin nong pai hi. Tu in Pathian mai ah ko teng na om ung, Topa ii nang son a hong sawl po ngai tu in hong ngak khu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Peter sia thuson tu hong kipan a, “Tu in Pathian in mihing theampo a kibangin ngaisun hi ci in ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama a biate le a maan a ngamtate sia, bang minam po ahizong ama in saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Israel te tungah a puak thu na heak uh hi, mihing theampo ii Topa ahi, Jesus Christ tungtawnin kilemna Lungdamna Thu thansakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuiphumpa John in tui kiphumna thu a hil zawkciang Galilee ngam pan Israel ngam bup sungah thu lian a piang sia, na heak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nazareth khua mi Jesus tungah Pathian in Thaa Thiangtho le vaangletna a buak thu huvau tel nu hi. Ama in mun theampo ah pai in, thupha vawt a, Doaimangpa vaangletna nuai ah a om theampo damsak hi. Banghang ziam cile Pathian sia ama taw omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel te ngamsung le Jerusalem ah a sep a vawt theampo tungtaang ah, kote in tetti ka hi uh hi. Amate in ama sia thinglamtee tungah kilh in, thisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in a ni thum ni ciangin, thina pan thosak a, ama kilanghsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />ahihang mihing theampo tungah hi ngawlin, Pathian ii tetti tu a hong teal sate, thina panin a thaw kik zawkciangin, ama taw an nekhawm tui dawnkhawmin a om kote tungah hong kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in, lungdamna thu sia mihingte tungah a hil tu le a thisate le a nungta laite tungah thukhen tu in, Pathian in ama a aap hunlam tetti pang tu in ko hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kamsaang theampo in ama huvau sonsiat uh hi. Ama a umte theampo mihing sim in ama min vaangletna taw a mawnate kimaisak tu hi ci in son uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuabangin Peter a papau laitakin, thu ngai theampo tungah, Thaa Thiangtho tuaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Peter taw Joppa khua pan hong pai, Jew thu umte in, Gentile te tung zongh ah, Pathian Thaa Thiangtho letsong a buak sia lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate in, kam tumdangte taw pau in, Pathian letna pok uh hi. Peter in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Hi mite in, eima saan bangma in, Thaa Thiangtho saang zo uh hi. Tua ahile amate tui taw ki baptize tu, akua in khaam thei tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus Christ min taw, a ki baptize natu in thupia hi. Tua zawkciangin, ni tawmvei amate kungah a taam lai natu in, Peter tho uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judea ngam bup a om sawltakte, le thu um dangte in, Gentile te zongh ii Pathian kammal a saanna thu za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Peter sia Jerusalem ah a cia ciangin, Gentile te vunteap atna a deite in, Peter ngamtatna sit uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Vunteap at ngawl Gentile te inn ah zintung in, an ngawngawn nekhawm nu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Peter in thupiang teng sia a patna panin son hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Joppa khua ah thu ka nget laitakin mukholna khat ka nei hi. Van panin puanza bang na khat a king li pan kilen in, a kikhiasuk ka mu a, tuaciang ka kungah hong tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pha takpi ma in a sung ka en a, innsa, ngamsa, le awmtaal in a vak nganhingte le ngam vacimte ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang aw khat in hong paupui a, ‘Peter awng, tho in; hite ngo in a, ne in!’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang keima in, ‘Ne peuma bua tong Topa awng! Biakna taw kisai a nin le a thiang ngawlin a kisepte sia, ka kam sungah tum ngeingawl lai hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua aw taw vantung panin, hong pau leleau a, “Pathian thiansua sate sia bang po ahizong, a thiang ngawlin ngaisun heak in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bangin thumvei hong kilak a, a khakbel ciangin, vantung ah kidok to kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun laitak lian in, Caesarea pan a hong kipaisak mihing thum sia, ka zintunna inn ah hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thaa in, amate taw haisaang ngawlin, ka tonkhop natu hong sawl hi. Joppa khua a thu uppui luk teng zongh in, Caesarea ah hong zui a, ka vekpi in Cornelius inn ah ka tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vantunglalang khat a inn ah na ding a, ama in, ‘Joppa khua ah mihing pawlkhat paisak ta'n a, Simon Peter kici khat sia samsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in nang le na innkuanpui theampo ngupna na nga natu kammalte hong son tu hi,’ ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabangin thuson ka kipat ciangin, Thaa Thiangtho sia eite tungah a masa a hong pai bang tatakin, amate tungah tuaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang ‘John in tui taw hong baptize hi. Ahihang no sia Thaa Thiangtho taw hong ki baptize tu hi,’ a ci Topa kam sia ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa Jesus ih up ciang ei tungah letsong hong kipiak bangin, Pathian in tua letsong sia Gentile te tung zongh ah pia hi, ci in thiangtho takin kimu hi; tua ahile kei sia akua hi a, Pathian nasepna a khaktan zo tu pa, hi na khi ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, Peter sia mawsak nawn ngawlin, Pathian pok uh hi. “Tua ahile Pathian in, Gentile te tung zongh ah, kisii kik natu le nuntak natu hunpha pia zo hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Stephen a suamlup zawkciang vawtsiatna hangin a kithethaang thu umte pawlkhat sia Phoenicia, Cyprus le Antioch dongin pai uh a, Jew te tung bek ah thuhil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Cyprus le Cyrene pan a, thu umte pawlkhat in Antioch khua ah pai in, Gentile te tung zongh ah Topa Jesus Lungdamna Thupha hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa vaangletna sia amate taw kop a, mihing tam mama in thu um in, Topa sangah kiheak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi thupha Jerusalem Pawlpi dong theng a, tua ahikom amate in, Barnabas sia Antioch khua ah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama a thet ciang, Pathian ii a mite thupha a piakzia mu ahikom ama lungdam a, Pathian tungah thin tak lung tak taw a thumaan natu in, amate theampo hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Barnabas sia mihing pha khat hi a, Thaa Thiangtho le upna taw kidim in, mihing tam mama Topa kung then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Barnabas in Saul zong tu in, Tarsus khua ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A zon pa a mu zawkciangin Antioch khua ah paipui a, amate nii in, pawlpi mite taw kum khat bup omkhawmin, Pawlpi mihon khat hilcianna nei hi. Tuabangin Antioch khua ah thu umte sia Tapidawte ci in kina masabel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin, kamsaang pawlkhat in Jerusalem pan Antioch ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate sung panin, Agabus min nei khat hong ding a, simleitung theampo ah kialpi a tun natu Thaa vaangletna taw ama in sonkhol hi. (Kumpilianpa Claudius maan hun laitakin, tua kialpi tung hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nungzuite in amate hi zawk zaza tek, Judea ngam ah a teang a thu up puite atu a neisate puak tu in, khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tubang ahi zawkciangin, a sum uh sia, Pawlpi upate ii nga tu in, Barnabas le Saul khut tungah thaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi hun laitakin, Kumpipa Herod in, pawlpi mi pawlkhat vawtsia tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in John suapuipa James namsau taw thatlumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi bang a, a ngamtat ciangin, Jew te thukim hi ci in a mu ciang, Peter zongh mansak hi. (Hi hun sia Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poai sung ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Peter sia a kimat zawkciang thonginn sungah khum a, ngalkap li veu pawl li kisua a, tuate in cingsak hi. Ama mipite mai ah Paisan Poai zawkciangin thusit tu in Herod in ngealna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom Peter thong sungah koi a, ahihang pawlpi mite in Pathian munah ama atu in nasia tak thu ngengen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipite mai ah Herod in Peter thusit tu ni ma zanin Peter sia thongcingte nii ii kilaklaw ah mutthip hi. Ama sia thikkhau nii taw kikhii a, a thong kongkha ah thongcingte in cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Topa vantunglalang khat tua munah ding a, thonginn doituam sung khuavak taang khat hong om hi. Vantunglalang in, Peter liangko panin lokin phong a, “Manlang in! Tho in!” ci hi. Thakhat thu in, thikkhaute Peter khut panin kizuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin vantunglalang in, “Na kawngkhau sawm in a, na peangdap thua in,” ci hi. Peter in tuabangin a vawt zawkciangin, vantunglalang in, “Na puantual silhin hong zui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Peter in thonginn doipua ah zui hi, ahizong ama in vantunglalang ii ngamtatna sia a takpi ma ziam ci in a tel bua hi; mukholna khat a mu kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in thongcingte ii phual masa sia a kaantan zawkciang a niina sia zongh kaantan uh a, a khakbelin khuapi sung tumna thik kongkha ah theng uh hi. Amate atu in kongkha sia ama thu in kihong a, amate pusuak hi. Tuaciang khuapi sung lampi khat a totsuk laitak thakhat thu in vantunglalang in Peter nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Peter in ama tungah bang thu piang, ci in phawk a, “Tu in a maan tatak sia ka he hi!” ci hi. “Topa in a vantunglalang khat sia, Herod ii vaangletna pan le Jew te ii kei tungah hong piang tu a upna theampo pan hong suatak tu in, hong paisak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a dinmun kitel ahikom, John Mark ii nu Mary inn ah pai hi, tua munah mihon kikhawm a, thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Peter in kongkha puanung sia king a, Rhoda kici numei naseam khat in inn hon tu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Peter aw tel a, lungdam leilam in, kongkha zongh hon meal ngawlin, heak kik hi. Inn sung a omte munah, Peter doipua ah ding hi, ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in, “Na thin amh hi!” ci uh hi. Ahihang numei nu in, a takpi ma hi, ci veve hi. Tua ahikom amate in, “Ama a keam vantunglalang hi vak,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua lan tengin, Peter in kongkha king top hi. A khakbel ciangin, amate in kong hon uh a, Peter a mu uh ciangin, lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate a thim natu in a khut taw lak a, thonginn sung pan Topa ii ama a pusuasakna thu teng son hi. “Hi thu James le thu um dangte munah son tavun,” a ci zawkciangin amate nusia in mun dang khat ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zingsang khuavak ciang, thongcingte sungah — Peter bang tawk ziam, ci in nasia takin buai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod in ama a zon natu thupia hikale, a mu zo bua uh hi. Tua ahikom ama in thongcingte thu donghsakin amate thalup tu in thupia hi. Hisia zawkciang, Herod in, Judea ngam nusia in, Caesarea ah hun tawmvei zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Herod in Tyre le Sidon mite tungah a thin uuk mama hi, tua ahikom amate in Herod taw kimu tu in, pai hon uh hi. A masa in kumpi inncingpa Blastus sia amate a hu tu in, a thinzosak phot uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate in Herod kungah pai in kilemna ngen uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate ngam ii anneak tu sia kumpipa ii ngam panin nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kiciam ni a thet ciangin, Herod in a kumpi puantual silhin kumpi tokhum tungah to a, mipite tungah thusonna khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A papau sia mihing hi ngawl a, pathian khat hi!” ci in amate au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Topa vantunglalang khat in Herod velvawk hi, banghang ziam cile ama in Pathian vaang a pia bua hi. Ama sia lungte in ne a thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua hun sungin, Pathian kammal kizel suak a, khang vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Barnabas le Saul in, amate ii ngamthak nasep man a, John Mark, tonpui in Jerusalem panin heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Antioch khua pawlpi sungah, kamsaang pawlkhat le syate om hi: Barnabas, (Civompa kici) Simeon, (Cyrene pan) Lucius, (Ngamuk mangpa Herod taw a no ciang a khang khawm) Manaen le Saul ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii na seamin antangin a om laitak, Thaa Thiangtho in, “Barnabas le Saul sia, amate ka sapna bangin nasep seam tu in, kei atu koituam tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate an tangin thungen a, amate tungah a khut uh a ngak zawkciangin, paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Barnabas le Saul sia, Thaa Thiangtho in tuabangin sawl ahi bangma, Seleucia khua ah pai a tua mun panin, Cyprus tuikulh ah teambaw taw ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salamis khua a thet uh ciangin, Jew te ii synagogue te ah Pathian thuhil uh hi. A nasepna hu tu in, John Mark zongh amate taw omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in tuikulh kaantan in, Paphos ah pai uh a, tua munah mitbum thiampa Bar-Jesus min nei, kamsaang ka hi a ci Jew te khat taw kisii uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in tuikulh ngamuk mangpa Sergius Paulus ii ngualtamh khat hi a, tua pa in mihing ciim khat ahi hi. Ngamukpa in Barnabas le Saul ama mai ah sam hi, banghang ziam cile, ama in Pathian thu za nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang mitbum thiampa Elymas (Greek min) in amate langpan hi, ama in ngamuk mangpa sia tua upna panin, a lampial natu in, hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Paul a kici Saul in Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim hi; ama in mitbum thiampa tangtan in salh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang Doaimangpa tapa awng! Nang in a pha ci theampo ii ngalin pang ni hi. Nang in ngitlo thimthel pilna theampo taw kidim ni hi, tuaciangin, Topa ii thumaan thutakte sia leilot thu suaksak tu in hanciam tawntung ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa khut in tu in, nang tungah hong paisuk tu hi; na mit tawcip tu a, tuaciangin, sun khuavak sia hun khat sung teng na mu thei buatu hi,” ci hi. Thakhat thu in, Elymas in, ama mittangte khuavui tuamcip bangin, thuak a, ama khut lenin lamlak tu mihing zongin, vak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngamuk mangpa in, thupiang teng a mu ciangin, ama in um hi. banghang ziam cile Topa thu a kihilciannate nasia takin, lamdang sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paul le a pawl a lawmte sia Paphos khua panin, teambaw taw ding a, Pamphylia ngam khuapi khat ahi Perga a thet uh ciangin, tuak ah John Mark in amate nusia in Jerusalem ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate sia Perga pan paisuak in, Pisidia ngam Antioch khua theng a, tuaciang Sabbath ni in synagogue sungah tum in to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses Thukham le kamsaangte lai atte a sim zawk uh ciangin, synagogue uliante in: “Suapuite awng, hanthot nopna thupuak nong nei uh le, mihingte tungah nong son tu ka dei uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Paul dingto in, a khut vaan a, thuson tu in kipan hi: “Hiak ah Pathian bia in a om, Israel minampuite le Gentile theampo awng: hong ngai tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel minamte ii Pathian in ih taanghpupite na teal a, Egypt ngam ah peamta in a teen hun sungin, minam lian khat in, na siam hi. Pathian in amate sia Egypt ngam panin, vaangletna lian taw pusua pui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kum sawmli sung sennealngam sungah, amate a thuak kenkon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Canaan ngam ah, minam salite lalsak in ama minamte in, a ngam uh luasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi hun sung theampo kum zali le kum sawmnga sung bang ahi hi. “Tuasia zawkciang Pathian in amate sia, kamsaangpa Samuel hun dong, thukhenmangte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in, kumpi khat a nget uh ciang Pathian in Benjamin suan Kish ii tapa Saul sia kum sawmli sung kumpi seam tu in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul a hep zawkciang Pathian in David sia kumpipa suaksak hi. Pathian in tua pa huvau hi bangin ci hi: ‘Jesse tapa David in ka thin taw a kisi mihing nam hi a, seam a ka oai theampo a seam tu pa khat hi ci in ka mu zo hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David ii suan Jesus sia Pathian in kamciam a piaksa bangma in, Israel mite ii Hunpa hisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesus in a nasep a kipat ma in, John in Israel te theampo a mawnate uh pan, kisiik kik hamtang in, tui a kiphum uh kul tu hi, ci in thuhil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang, John in a nasep a zaw kuan sang ciangin, mihingte munah, ‘Kei sia akua hong sa nu ziam? Kei sia note ii lamen a na ngak uh pa hi ngawl khi hi. Ahihang ngai vun! Ama in kei nungah hong pai lai tu a, ama peangdap suut tu in, ka kilawm bua hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Abraham suan Israel ka mipuite le, hi sungah Pathian a bia Gentile te theampo awng, hi ngupna thu ei tungah hong kipuak zo ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua in banghang ziam cile, Jerusalem ah a om mihingte le a lampuite in ama sia Hunpa ahi hunlam he ngawl a, Sabbath ni sim a kisim kamsaangte ii kammalte zongh a tel bua uh hi. Ahihang amate in Jesus a puavawk na uh taw, kamsaangte sonna teng, a taangtungsak a suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in, Jesus tungah thidaan a piak natu thu mu zo ngawl ahihang Pilate munah, a thalupsak natu in ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Laithiangtho sungah ama huvau a kison theampo a vawt zawkciang amate in thinglamtee tung pan khiasuk a, thaankuul khat sungah koi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in thina pan thosak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaciang Galilee pan Jerusalem ah a khualhaw puite tungah ni tam ma kilak hi. Tu in amate in Israel mite tungah ama ii tetti te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaciangin Lungdamna Thupha no tungah hong puak tu in, kote hi sungah kong om uh hi: Pathian ii ih taanghpupite tungah a sep a vawt tu kamciam a piak sia, Jesus nungta kik tu in, a thaw kiksakna taw, ei a suan a paalte tungah, tu in tua kamciam hong tungsak ahi hi. Psalm a niina sungah hi bangin ki at hi, ‘Nang in ka Tapa na hi hi; tuni in na Pa ka suak zo hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thina sung pan a thaw kik natu le, thaan sungah a muat ngeingawl natu in, Pathian sonna in hi bangin ci hi, ‘David tungah ka kamciam ahi a thiangtho le a maan thupha sia no tungah kong pia tu hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Laithiangtho mundang khat ah zongh hi bangin ci takpi hi. ‘Nang tungah a thumaan na naseampa thaan sungah na muatsak nuam buatu hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile David in a nuntak lai in Pathian ii deinate a sepsak zawkciang thi a, a taanghpupite taw kivui khawmin thaan sungah muat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian ii thina pan a thaw kiksak pa sia thaan sungah muat ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka mipui Israel te awng, na heak tu ka dei uh thu sia Jesus tungtawnin mawnate kimaisakna hong kihilna thu hi; ama a um peuma in, Moses thukham ii hong suataksak zawk ngawl mawnate theampo panin, hong kisuataksakna thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahikom kamsaangte ii hi bangin a ci teng sia, no tungah hong tun ngawl natu in, kidawm tavun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />‘En vun, ngual selno theite awng! Lamdang sa in thi tavun! Banghang ziam cile tuni in ka nasep sia a khiakna hong son a om hial zong, na um thei buatu hi!’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in synagogue a nusiat uh laitakin, Sabbath ni kik ciang, amate pai kik a, hi thute a son thua lai natu in mite in sam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kikhopna panin mipite a cia zawkciangin, Paul le Barnabas sia Jew mi tam mama le Jew te biakna sungah a tum Gentile mi tam mama in zui uh hi. Pathian ii thuthiamna sungah kip in, a nuntak natu sawltakte in, amate sonpui in hanthawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sabbath ni kik ciangin, khuapi sungah a om mihing theampo phial in Topa kammal ngai tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jew te in mihonpite a mu ciangin, eenna thin taw kidim uh a; Paul thusonte nialin, selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahihang Paul le Barnabas in, hang seseam in thuson uh hi: “Pathian thu, no kungah hong kihil maksak tu kisamh hi. Ahihang tuasia nialin tawntung nuntakna taw noma le noma kiphu na kisak ngawl uh hu in, no hong nusia in, Gentile te kungah pai tu khu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hi sia Topa ii hong thupiak ahi hi; ‘Leitung bup a kingup thei natu, Gentile te atu in nang sia khuavak khat in kong vawt zo hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Gentile te in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, lungdam a, Topa ii thupuak a pok uh hi; tuaciangin tawntung nuntakna nga tu a, a kiteal sate thu umte suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ngamsung mun theampo ah Topa kammal kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahihang Jew te in khuapi sung lampui upate le Pathian a bia Gentile numei a ci thei thu neite hol uh hi. Amate in Paul le Barnabas vawtsiat kipan a, ngam puasia ah hawlkeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Sawltakte in amate a nalhna in, a peang tungah a baang leivuite thin san uh a, Iconium ah paitan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Antioch khua ah thu umte in lungdamna le Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Iconium khua zongh ah tuabang ma in thu piang hi: Paul le Barnabas sia synagogue ah pai in thu a son uh ciangin, Jew te le Gentile mihing tam mama thu um hong suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang a um nuam ngawl Jew te in, Gentile te holin thu umte langpansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawltakte tua munah khuangei ma taamin, Topa huvau hangsan takin hil uh hi; Topa thuthiamna huvau amate ii thupuakna maan hi sia le nalamdang lakna te le a lamdangte vawt thei na vaang Topa in amate tungah a piakna taw kiciansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuapi sungah mihingte kikhen uh a: pawlkhat in Jew te panpui a, a dang teng in sawltakte sangah pang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Gentile te le Jew te pawlkhat in amate ii lampuite taw kopin, sawltakte vawtsiat tu khensat a, suangtum taw den sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawltakte in hi thu a phaw uh ciangin, Lycaonia ngam khuapi liante ahi Lystra le Derbe khuate le a kiim ngam teng ah tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua munah amate in Lungdamna Thupha hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lystra khua ah a pian pan kipan, a peangbai a, lampai thei ngeingawl, pasal khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuak ah Paul ii thuson ngai in to hi. Paul in ama ii upna mu a, kidamsak thei tu ci in mu ahikom ama tangtan in en a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na peang taw dingmaam in!” nging takin ci hi. Pasalpa zongh kilawn to in, vak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihonpite in Paul nasepna a mu uh ciangin, amate in Lycaonia kam taw au tek uh a, “Pathiante sia mihing bang suakin, ei kungah hong paisuk hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Barnabas sia Zeus ci in min pia a, Paul sia a thusonpipa ahikom, Hermes ci in min pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeus pathian biakinn sia khuapi pua sangah om a, a thiampipa in khuitalte le paakte taw biakpiakna vawt natu in, khuapi kongbiang ah paipui hi. Banghang ziam cile, ama le mihonpite in sawltakte sangaw biakpiakna pia nuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua mite in bang vawt sawm ci thu a zaak ciangin Barnabas le Paul in, amate puansilh lai uhte baltham in tai a, mihonpite laizang tuu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Banghangin hi bangin, ngamta thong nu ziam? Ko zongh mihing thawthong hi a, noma bangma hi lel khu hi! Ko sia hi sungah, Lungdamna Thupha thangsak tu, hi a man nei ngawl nate panin a nungta Pathian sangah hong kiheaksak tu ka hi uh hi. Tua Pathian in vantung, leitung, tuipi, le tuate sung a om theampo a vawtpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A bosa hunte sungah, ama in mihing theampo a uuk bang tek po in ngamtasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang, ama ii na pha a vawtte taw ama a om hunlam sia kitelthiangsak tawntung hi: Ama in note vantung pan nguatui hong pia a, lo ante a hun maanin hong pia hi. Ama in an hong pia a, na thinsung uh lungdamna taw, hong kidimsak hi,” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sawltakte in, hi bang teng pau napi mihonte ii amate sangaw biakpiakna a piak nopna pan khaam la dektak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pisidia ngam Antioch khua pan le Iconium panin Jew te pawlkhat hong pai hi; amate sangah mihonpite zol zo in Paul sia suang taw deang a, tuaciang thi zo sa ahikom khua pua ah taalkai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang thu umte ama kiimkot ah hong kikhoptua uh ciangin, ama thoto a, khua sungah pai kik hi. A zing ciangin ama le Barnabas sia Derbe khua zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in Derbe khua ah Lungdamna Thupha hil uh a, nungzui tam mama nga uh hi. Tua zawkciangin amate Lystra ah pai kik a, tua mun panin Iconium ah, tua zawkciang Pisidia ngam Antioch khua ah paisuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in thu umte thakho sua uh a, upna sungah thumaan in a kip natu uh hanthawn uh hi. “Pathian Ngam sungah ih tum thei natu in, ngimna tam mama ih kaantan kul tu hi,” ci in hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in pawlpi sim ah pawlpi upate tealin koi uh a, thungetna le an tanna taw amate ii muan ahi Topa tungah tua upate aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pisidia ngam a kaantan zawk uh ciangin, Pamphylia ngam theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Perga khua mite tungah thu a hil zawkciangin, Attalia khua ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua mun panin Antioch khua ah teambaw taw ding kik uh hi. Tua khua sia, tu a, amate ii nasep a mansa uh sia atu in Pathian ii thuthiamna sungah a ki aapna khua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Antioch a thet uh ciangin, amate in, pawlpi mite khawmtua a, amate tungah, Pathian nasepna theampo le Gentile te ii thu a up natu lampi a honsakna thute son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate tua munah thu um mite taw khuangei ma taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judea panin, Antioch ah mihing pawlkhat hong pai a, thu umte tungah, hi bangin hilcian tu in hong kipan in, “Moses thukham om bangin, na vunteap uh na at bua uh le, ngupna na nga thei buatu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in hi thu huvau ah, amate taw nasia takin, kinial uh hi. Tua ahikom Paul, Barnabas le Antioch khua a om pawlkhat, Jerusalem ah hi thu taw kisai in pai a, sawltakte le upate taw kimu tu in, khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawlpi ii sawlna taw amate a pai hi a, Phoenicia le Samaria kaantan in, a pai uh ciangin, Gentile te ii Pathian sangah a kikhealna thu ko uh hi. Tua thu in thu um theampo, nasia takin lungdamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem a thet uh ciangin, pawlpi in amate vai na dawn uh a, sawltakte le pawlpi upate tungah amate tungtawnin Pathian ii a sepna theampo son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Phariseete pawlsung panin, thu um mi pawlkhat ding a, “Gentile te in, vunteap a at uh kul tu hi. Moses Thukham a nit natu son kul tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawltakte le pawlpi upate, hi thu huvau kikum tu in, kisitua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngei ma a kinial zawk uh ciang, Peter ding a, “Ka suapuite awng, khuangei pek lai in, Gentile te ii a zaak thei natu le a up thei natu in, Lungdamna Thupha hil tu in, no sung pan Pathian in keima hong teal ahi hunlam sia na heak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang, a kuama po ii thinsung a tel Pathian in, Gentile te a saanna, a lakna in ei tungah hong piak bangma in, amate tungah Thaa Thiangtho pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in ei le amate hong doi tuan ngawl hi. Amate in um ahikom a mawnate maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahile eite ih hizong, taanghpupite ahizong, a puak zawk ngawl vanhte thu umte nungzaang ah suanhin, banghang tu in Pathian ze et sawm nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suak ngawl hi! Eite in zongh amate bangma ih um a, Topa Jesus thuthiamna taw ngupna ih nga hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in Pathian ii amate tungtawn a, Gentile te sungah, nalamdang laknate le a lamdang theampo a sep a vawt a ko uh a zaak uh ciangin, a pawl bup thim dide in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A son tu teng a man zawkciangin, James hong pau a “Hong ngai tavun, suapuite awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate sung panin, ama atu minam tuam khat a laakna taw Pathian in Gentile te a thinbotna a lak phitna thu sia, Simon in a son zawk bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamsaangte kammalte zongh hi thu taw kisi siat hi. Laithiangtho in hi bang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Hisia zawkciangin Topa in kong heak kik tu ci hi, tuaciangin David kumpi ngam ka pua pha kik tu hi. A lalcipna pan ka sa kik tu a, ka thahatsak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciangin midang theampo le, keima neisa tu in ka sapsa Gentile mi theampo in kei hong zuan tu hi ci in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />hi thu taangh tawngh laipek pan a hesak Topa in son hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />James in, “Kei ngaisutna ah, Pathian sangah a kiheak ahi Gentile te, ih buaisak ngawl tu sia thupi ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hi ngawl zawin, amate tungah lai ih thaak tu a, milim biakna in a kizak hu in a thiangtho ngawl ante a neak ngawl natu; numei le pa khialna panin, a kikep natu; nganhing a tawl kimeaklumte sa a neak ngawl natu le sachi neak ngawl natu, lai thaakin ih son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, Moses Thukham sia Sabbath ni simin, synagogue te ah khuangei hialma kisim zo a, ama kammalte sia khua sim ah kihil zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, sawltakte le pawlpi upate in pawlpi mi bup taw kikum a, Paul le Barnabas taw Antioch ah pai tu in, pawl sung pan mihing pawlkhat a teal natu khensat uh hi. Amate in Barsabbas kici Judas le Silas teal uh hi. Amate ngeal sia thu umte ii a zatak mama ahi uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate in hi laithakte puasak uh hi: “Ko sawltakte le pawlpi upate, na suapuite in Antioch, Syria le Cilicia a teang Gentile suapuite theampo tungah, kipaupuina lai kong thaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eima pawl sung panin, mihing pawlkhat in, amate ii sonna taw no hong thinngimsak, hong nawngkaisak tu in, hong pai hi, ci in za khu hi; ahihang hi bangin hong ngamtat natu in, ko tung pan amate in bangma sawlna nga ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka kikhawm uh a, thataak pawlkhat tealin no kungah paisak tawng, ci in ka thukim siat uh hi. Amate sia ih it ih lawmte ahi Barnabas le Paul taw hong paikhawm tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />amate sia Topa Jesus Christ nasepna atu, a nuntakna uh a bo tu a lauhuai dongin, a kipumpiakte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Judas le Silas kong paisak uh hi. Amate in lai taw kong at uh teng, kam taw hong son tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho le ko ii thukimna pan, hi zui tu a kul ngeinate ngawl buang a dang vanhngit kong suan nuam bua uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />milim biakna ah a kipiasa an peuma na ne heak vun; sachi na ne heak vun; a tawl a kimeaklum nganhingte sa na ne heak vun. Numei le pa khialna panin, na kikeam tavun. Hi teng na tang zo po le uhte pha tu hi. Dam tek tawng.” ci in at uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thataakte kipaisak a, Antioch khua theng uh hi. Tua munah thu umte pawl bupin kikhawm a, a laithak sia pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A laithak a sim uh ciangin, hanthotna kam in, amate lungdamna taw kidimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate mama kamsaang ahi Judas le Silas in, thu umte taw ngei ma thuson khawm uh a, thin letna le tha ngana neisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua munah hun tawmvei a zak zawk uh ciangin, thu umte in amate thinnuam takin tha kik uh a, amate in pai tu a sawlte kungah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang Silas in tua munah taam tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in, Antioch ah hun tawmvei sung zangh uh a, mi dang tam mama taw kikop in, Topa kammal hilcian in thuhil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang Paul in Barnabas tungah, “Heak kik tawng i, Topa kammal ih thuhilna khua sim ah a om ih suapuite munah haw kikin, amate bangbang om ziam, ci in dawp tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Barnabas in, John Mark sia amate taw tonpui nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in, tua pa a kaizot tu sia suak a sa bua hi. Banghang ziam cile, a nasep man dong, ompui ngawlin, John Mark in amate sia Pamphylia ah nusia in heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate nasia takin kinial a, kikhen uh hi: Barnabas in Mark samin Cyprus zuan tu in, teambaw taw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thu umte in Topa ii a thuthiamna sungah a kepcing natu in, a aap zawkciang, Paul ahile Silas teal a, ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in Syria le Cilicia kaantan in pai a, pawlpite tha kho sak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul in Derbe le Lystra khua Timothy kici Tapidaw khat ii teenna ah khualhaw suak hi. A nu zongh Jew minam Tapidaw khat hi a, ahihang a pa sia Greek te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lystra le Iconium khua thu umte theampo in Timothy sia phat son tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in Timothy tonpui nuam ahikom a vunteap atsak hi. Ama in tuabang a vawtsak sia, banghang ziam cile, tua munah a teang Jew theampo in Timothy ii pa sia Greek ahi hunlam he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in khuate kaantan in a pai uh ciangin, Jerusalem a sawltakte le pawlpi upate ii a khensat zui tu ngeinate thu umte tungah pia uh a, tua ngeinate a zui natu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pawlpite upna sungah kithakhosak vaial a, mihing zongh ni simin khangto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Phrygia le Galatia ngamte kaantan in, khualhaw uh hi, banghang ziam cile, Asia ngamkhen sungah amate ii thuhil tu Thaa Thiangtho in a oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mysia ngamngi a thet uh ciangin, amate in Bithynia ngamkhen sungah, pai tu in kithoai hi. Ahihang Jesus ii Thaa in a oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Mysia ngam kaantan in khualhaw a, Troas khua ah amate paisuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paul in tua zanin a mukholna sungah Macedonia te pasal khat a ding mu in, ama tungah “Macedonia ngam ah hong pai ta'n a, hong hu ta'n!” ci in hesuak ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paul in hi mukholna a mu zawk po ciang, Macedonia ah pai tu in, ka kithoai uh hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in, Lungdamna Thupha sia tua mun mite tungah hil tu in hong sam zo hi, ci in ka khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Troas panin teambaw taw ka ding uh a, Samothrace tuikulh kan in, a zing ciangin Neapolis ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua mun panin lei lam taw Philippi ah ka pai uh a, tua khuapi sia Macedonia ii ngamkhen masabel sia ii khuapi ahi hi. Tua in Rome kumpite ukna ngam khat hi si hi. Tua munah ni tam mama ka taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabbath ni in khuapi puasia ah pusuak in, ngun hui ah Jew te thungetna mun khat om tu ka ngaisutna munah ka pai uh hi. Ka to uh a, tua munah a kikhawm numeite thu ka sonpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu hong ngaite khat sia Thyatira khua pan Lydia hi a, ama in puan sandup zuak nu khat ahi hi. Ama in Pathian a bia numei khat hi a, Paul thusonna teng a ngai tu in, Topa ii a thinsung a honsak nu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama le a innkuanpuite in tui a kiphum zawkciangin, ama in ko hong sam hi, “Kei sia Topa a um tatak mihing khat ci in na khensat uh le, hong pai tavun a, ka inn ah hong taam tavun,” ci hi. Ama inn ah ka pai natu in hong zol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni khat thungetna munah pai tu in ka pai uh laitakin maisang a hong piang pheang tu, thu a sonkhol thei doai ngilo vei innteang naseam numei khat taw ka kisi uh hi. Mai lamsang thu tu a sonkhol theina taw a tote atu sum tam mama thalawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Paul le ko hong zui a, “Hi mite in A saangbel Pathian naseamte hi! Note bangbangin kingum thei tu ci thu amate in hong thangsak hi!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni tam mama sung hi bangin, Paul a thin uuk dong au a, Paul a thin uuk ciang kingeilee in, doai munah, “Jesus min taw numei nu sung pan na pusua natu thu kong pia hi,” ci hi. Tua hun lian laitakin, doai in numei nu sung panin pusuak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A tote in amate sum nga natu lampi bo ahi hunlam a phaw uh ciangin Paul le Silas sia pummat uh a, mihon kikhopna tual thunei upate mai ah kai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rome kumpi uliante mai ah paipui uh a, “Hi mite in Jew te hi a, koma khuapi sungah buaina piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in ko thukham a langpan ngeinate hil uh hi; ko sia Rome ngammite khu hi, hi ngeinate saang thei ngawl, zangh thei ngawl tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihon zongh in, Paul le Silas a ngal vawtte sangah pang uh hi. Tua zawkciang uliante in, Paul le Silas te ii puan laaithapsak a, saat tu in thupia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nasia takin, a kisaat zawkciang amate sia thonginn sung denna in kinei a, thong ukpa munah kho bikbek in a kalh natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi thupiakna a nga ciangin, thong ukpa in, amate sia thonginn sungsang doituam sungah, khumin, a peangte thingkol bulsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zankim hun ciangin, Paul le Silas in Pathian tungah thungen in, biakna late sa in om a, thongtaak dangte in ngai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thakhat thu in, nasia tak zinliing a, thonginn phungkawng tawdap theampo dong ngawk hi. Thakhat thu in, kongkhapi theampo kihong a, thongtaak theampo tung pan thikkolte peal siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thong ukpa khanglo a, thong kongkhapi theampo kihong sa in, a om a mu ciang, thongtaak theampo suakta siat zo sa hi; tua ahikom, ama le ama kithatlum tu in, a namsau dok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in, a aw nei za taw oksan in, “Nangma le nangma bangma kilaw heak in! Hi sungah kote om siat khu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thong ukpa in meivak khat ngen a, thonginn doituam sungah tai kawm in tum a, Paul le Silas te peang ah liingin bok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, amate ngeal pusua in, “Tote awng, ngupna ka nga natu in bang vawt tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Topa Jesus um in, tuaciang, nang hong kingum tu hi — nang le na innkuanpuite ngupna na nga tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in ama le ngualdang ama inn ah a omte tungah Topa kammal hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua zan tua hun mama in, thong ukpa in, amate pusuapui in, a liamna mate silsak hi; tuaciangin ama le a innkuan bupin tui kiphum paih uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in Paul le Silas a inn ah ciapui a, anvaak hi. Ama le a innkuanpuite in lungdamna taw kidim uh hi, banghang ziam cile, tu in amate in Pathian um zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zingsang ciangin Rome kumpi thuneite in, palik bute paisak a, “Tua mihingte pusua vun,” ci in thupia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahikom thong ukpa in, Paul munah, “Uliante in nang le Silas hong kisuataksak natu thu hong pia hi. Pusuak thei tu nu hi, tua hi a, thinnuam in na pai tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in palik bute munah, “Ko bangma khialna lian nei ngawl khu hi. Ahihang mihonpite mai ah velna thuak khu hi — ko sia Rome ngammite hi khu hi! Tua zawkciang thonginn sung denna in hong kinei hi. Tuaciang tu leleau in a thimtham in, hong suaktasak nuam nu ziam. Suak thei ngawl tu hi! Rome uliante amate mama hi sungah hong pai hamtang tahen a, hong pusuaksak tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Palik bute in hi kammal teng, Rome uliante munah ko uh hi; tuaciang amate in, Paul le Silas sia Rome ngammi ahi hunlam a zaak uh ciangin, amate lau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate pai in, Paul le Silas te tungah pakaai uh hi; tua zawkciang, thonginn sung pan pusuak in khuapi a nusiat natu in sawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Paul le Silas in thonginn nusia in, Lydia ii inn zuan uh hi. Tua munah thu umte taw kimu uh a, hanthotna kammalte a son zawkciang nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul le Silas in Amphipolis le Apollonia kaantan in khualhaw a, synagogue khat omna Thessalonica khua theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii hun a zak ngei tawntung bangma in, Paul in tua synagogue ah pai hi. Tua munah Sabbath ni thum sung Laithiangtho sisanh in, mipite taw thu kikum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Messiah in ngim thuak tu a, thina panin tho kik tu hi, ci in Laithiangtho taw kipsakin sonthiang hi. Paul in, “No tungah kong pualaak hi Jesus sia Messiah ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sung panin pawlkhat in um a, Paul le Silas te pawm uh hi; tuabang ma in Pathian a bia Greek te honkhat le numei lampui tam mama te zongh in um a pawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Jew te in eang a, lamdung ah a vakthap mihing mannung ngawl pawlkhat khawmtua in, mihing ngilo nuam honkhat piangsak hi. Amate in a khuathing in buaisak uh a, Paul le Silas zongin mipite mai ah a kaikeak thei natu in Jason ii inn sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang amate a mu ngawl uh ciang, Jason le thu um dang pawlkhat khuapi thuneite mai ah kai a, “Hi mite in mun theampo ah nawngkaisak uh hi! Tu zonghin amate ei khua ah hong pai uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciang Jason in, amate sia ama inn ah keam hi. Amate theampo in, Kumpilianpa ii thukhamte paltan a, Jesus a minnei kumpipa dang khat om hi ci uh hi,” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi kammal teng taw khuapi sungah mihonte le khuapi thuneite buaisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuneite in Jason le a dang teng a suatak natu in, a kisamh za sum piasak a, tua zawkciangin amate paisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuazan po ciang, thu umte in Paul le Silas sia, Berea khua ah puak uh hi. A thet ciangin, amate synagogue ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khua mite in Thessalonica khua mite sangin ngaisun kaak thei zaw uh hi. Amate in lawpna lian taw thusonte ngai in, Paul thusonte maan tatak ziam ci in a heak natu in ni simin Laithiangtho en uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate sung pan mihing tam mama in thu um a; Greek te a ci thei numei tam mama le Greek te pasal tam mama zongh in um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Thessalonica ah a om Jew te in, Pathian kammal sia Bereate tung zongh ah, Paul in hil zo hi ci in, a zaak uh ciangin, hong pai a, mihing ngilo nuam honkhat hol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu umte in thakhat thu in, Paul sia tuipivaal ah puak uh hi; ahihang Silas le Timothy te ngeal Berea ah taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Paul a thate in Athens dong zui uh a, tua zawkciang Berea ah heak kikin, Silas le Timothy in, a manlang thei zaza in, a del natu Paul ii kam vaithak teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Silas le Timothy ngakin, a om laitak Paul in Athens khua ah milim biakna a dim in om a mu ciangin Paul sia nasia takin a thinkiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jew te le Pathian a bia Gentile te taw synagogue sung le, ni simin hong pai pawpo taw zongh mipi kikhopna leitual ah Paul in thu kikuppui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Epicurean syate le Stoic syate zongh in, ama taw thu kinial uh hi. Pawlkhat in, “He ngawl napi, a kihesak hisia pa in, bang teng son nuam ziam,” ci in dongh hi. A dangte in, “Ama ii son sia, ngamdangte pathiante hi tuak hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Banghang hi bangin ci ziam cile, ama in Jesus thu le a thaw kikna thu a hil hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Paul sia Areopagus kici Athen te ii council kikhopna munah paipui a, hi bangin ci uh hi, “Hi hilna thak na sawson sia, he nuam khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thu pawlkhat na son kong zaak uhte sia, ko atu in tumdang ahikom, a khiakna he nuam tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />(Banghang ziam cile, Athens khua mi theampo le tuak ah a teang ngamdangmite in, thuthak sonna le zaakna taw a hun theampo zangh nuam uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuapi council kikhopna mai ah Paul ding a, “Athen te awng, na theampo sungah biakna lamsang kin mamate na hi hunlam ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na khuapi sung kaantan in, ka pai a, na biakna munte ka et ciangin, ‘A kihe ngawl Pathian khat Atu,’ ci in biaknatau khat tungah, lai ki at ka mu hi. Tua ahiciang na heak ngawl bul na biak uh Pathian sia, tu in a thu kong thansak sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitung le a sung a om theampo a vawt, Pathian sia vantung le leitung ii Topa hi a, mihing khutte taw a kivawt biakinnte sungah a teang bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingte ii ama atu ih sepsakna pan, ih piak thei tu na khat zongh, ama atu in a kitaangsamh bua hi, banghang ziam cile mihing theampo atu nuntakna, husanna le na theampo ama ii hong piaksa hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in mihing khat panin, mihing nam theampo bitphua a, leitung buppi ah teangsak hi. Ama in amate teen natu a hunte le a munte see kholsa in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihingte ii ama a zon thei natu le ama a mu thei thaak natu in hi bangin vawt hi. Ahizong a tatakin Pathian in ei khat pawpo kung panin khuala ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mihing khat in, ‘Ama sungah ei ih nungta a, ngamta in ih om hi’ a ci bangma ahi hi. Noma ii la phua pawlkhat zongh in, ‘Ei zongh ama tate ih hi hi’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ei sia Pathian ii tate ih hi zawk nungsang in, ama pianzia sia mihingte pilna le thiamna taw a kivawt khamh, ngunn le suang milim khat pawpo bangin ih ngaisun buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihingte ii ama ih heak ngawl lai hunte, Pathian in heak ngawl bawl hikale tu hun ciang, mihingte a vekpi in mun theampo ah, amate tatsiatnate pan a kikheal natu ama in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama in, leitung bup ah thukhaikim thu taw, ama ii tealsa mihing khat zangh in, thu a khen natu in, ni khat, ciangtan sa in koi hi. Hi thu a maanna thu sia, tua pa thina panin a thawsak kikna taw mihing sim tungah a lak zo hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thina panin a thawsak kikna huvau, Paul ii son a zaak uh ciangin, pawlkhat in nunauna in nei uh a, ahihang a dangte in, “Hi thu huvau na son sia za kik nuam lai khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahikom Paul in kikhopna nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasal pawlkhat in ama pawmin thu um uh hi, tuate sungah council mi ahi Dionysius om a; Damaris a kici numei khat le a dang pawlkhat zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia zawkciang, Paul in Athens nusia in Corinth ah paisuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah ama in Italy pan a zi Priscilla taw hong pai tawm Pontus khua ah a suak Jew te Aquila a kici khat taw kimu hi, banghang ziam cile Kumpilianpa Claudius in Jew te theampo Rome khua a nusiat natu in, thupia hi. Paul in amate taw kimu tu in pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate taw taam khawm naseam khawm in om hi, banghang ziam cile amate bangma in, Paul in a nuntak natu in tuipuan buk khui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Jew te le Greek te a telsak thei natu in, Sabbath ni simin synagogue ah thu kikum khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Macedonia pan Silas le Timothy a thet ciang, Paul in hunbit in thuhilna zangh a, Jesus sia Messiah hi ci in Jew te tungah tetti pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in nalh in, ama huvau kamsia a pau uh ciang, ama in a lungkim ngawlna a lakna in, a puan tungah leivui baangte thin a, “Na mangthang uh le noma mawna hang hi tu hi! Kei hang hi ngawl tu hi. Tu pan kipan Gentile te kungah pai tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate nusia in, Titius Justus kici Pathian a bia Gentile mite khat ii inn ah teang tu in, pai hi; tua pa ii inn sia synagogue hui ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jew te ii synagogue ah a lampuipa Crispus le a innkuanpui theampo in Topa um uh hi; Corinth a midang tam mama in ngupna thu za uh a, um in tui kiphum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan khat Paul in mukholna nei a, Topa in ama tungah, “Lau heak in, na son ngei bangma in son in a, tua thu thasua heak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />banghang ziam cile keima in nang hong ompui ka hikom, kuama in nang hong susia thei ngawl tu hi. Hi khuapi sung a om mihing tam mamate sia keima mi ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom Paul in tua munah kum khat le kum lang taam a, mihingte tungah Pathian kammal hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gallio sia Rome kumpite in Achaia ngamuk mangpa tu in a koi uh ciangin, Jew te hong kikhawmtua a, Paul manin, thukhenzum ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Hi sia pa in thukham taw a kisi ngawl biaknazia taw Pathian biak natu mihingte zol tu in hanciam hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Paul in thuson tu in a kithoai laitak, Gallio in Jew te tungah, “Hi thu sia ngitlo khialna lian ahibuale khialna khat po a vawt ahi tha le, no Jew te tungah kong thinsau kenkon natu kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang hi thu sia kammalte, minte le noma thukham taw kisai thu kinialna ahikom noma tek ma in khensat hamtang tavun. Tuabangte tungtaang ah thukhenpa seam ngawl tu khi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciangin amate sia zum sung panin, not hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate theampo in synagogue lampuipa Sosthenes man uh a, zum mai ah vel uh hi. Ahihang Gallio in tuasia tawm zongh a awlmaw bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Paul in Corinth khua ah thu umte taw ni tam ma taam a, tua zawkciang amate nusia in Priscilla le Aquila taw Syria ah teambaw taw ding uh hi. Cenchreae pan teambaw taw a din ma in, a kiciamna khat hu in, a lu a tol in meet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Ephesus khua theng a, tua munah Paul in Priscilla le Aquila nusia hi. Ama in synagogue ah pai a, Jew te taw thu kikum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in khuangei zaw a taam lai natu in ama tho uh hi. Ahihang ama a thukim bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taam ngawl zaw in a din tu ciang, “Pathian ii deina ahile no kungah kong pai kik tu hi,” ci hi. Tuabangin ama Ephesus panin teambaw taw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Caesarea a thet ciangin, Jerusalem ah pai a, pawlpi mite paupui in, tua zawkciang Antioch ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua munah hun tawmvei a zak zawkciang ding kik hi. Ama in Galatia le Phrygia ngamte kaantan in pai a, thu um theampo thakhosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Alexandria khua ah a suak Apollos kici Jew te pasal khat Ephesus khua ah hong pai hi. Ama in thuson thiam khat hi a, Laithiangtho zongh a khawng a kheakin he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama sia Topa Lampi a kihil sa khat hi a, tha lawpna lianpi taw Jesus thu thangsak a, maan takin hil hi. Ahitazong ama ii heak sia in John ii tuiphumna bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jew te ii synagogue ah hangsan takin thuson tu in kipan hi. Priscilla le Aquila in ama thu a zaak uh ciang, amate inn ah ciapui uh a, Pathian Lampi a maan zaw lai in hil thiang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Apollos in Achaia ah pai tu in khensat ahikom, Ephesus ah thu umte in, ama a huna in Achaia ngam a om thu umte laithaksak a, pha takin vai a mua natu in hanthawn uh hi. Ama a thet ciangin, Pathian ii thuthiamna taw thu um a suakte atu in, a huna lian mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, Jesus sia Messiah a hina thu, Laithiangtho sisanh in a lak telna taw in mihonte mai ah, Jew te taw kam kinialnate sungah a mawngnei mama kam nialnate taw Jew te a zo ngawp hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Corinth khua ah Apollos a om laitak, Paul sia tua ngamkhen sungsang kaantan in khualhaw a, Ephesus theng hi. Tua munah nungzuite pawlkhat mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang, ama in “Thu um mite na sua uh ciang, Thaa Thiangtho na nga uh ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in “Thaa Thiangtho a om hunlam za zongh za bua ung,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pha hi, tua ahile bang tui kiphumna nam sia na saang uh ziam?” ci in Paul in dongh hi. “John ii tuiphumna sia hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paul in, “John ii tuiphumna sia in mawnate pan a kisiikte atu ahi hi; tuaciang ama in Israel te tungah, ama nung pan hong paipa na um vun — - tua pa in Jesus hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, Topa Jesus min taw tui kiphum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paul in amate tungah a khut nga a, Thaa Thiangtho amate tungah hong theng hi; amate in kam tumdangte taw pau uh a, Pathian ii ngupna thute zongh thangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a vekpi in, sawm le nii khawng pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paul in Jew te synagogue ah pai a, tha thum sung hangsan takin mihingte tungah thuson a, amate taw thu kikum in, Pathian Ngam thu a upsak zawk natu hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang pawlkhatte a thinpui in, a um nuam bua uh a, mihon bup mai ah amate in Topa Lampi sonsia uh hi. Tua ahikom Paul in amate nusia in, thu umte paipui a, ni simin Tyrannus laihilna inndoi lian sungah kikupna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bangin kum nii tawntung a kalsuanpui ciangin Asia ngamkhen a teang Jew te le Gentile te in Topa kammal za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paul tungtawnin Pathian in nidang in a om ngeingawl, nalamdang laknate vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama zak mai nawlna le awmdap puante ngawngawn ciinate kungah a kipaipui ciangin a natnate dam a, thaa ngilote zongh amate sung pan pusuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jew te pawlkhat khualhaw in vakkot a, thaa ngilo a notte zongh in thaa ngilo a naw natu in, Topa Jesus min zak tu hanciam uh hi. Amate in thaa ngilo te munah, “Paul ii a hil Jesus min taw keima in thu kong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unau salite ahi, Jew te Thiampi Lianbel Sceva a kici sia ii tapate in hi bang seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang thaa ngilo in amate tungah, “Jesus sia he khi hi, tuaciang Paul zongh he khi hi; ahihang no akua te nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaa ngilo veipa in amate nasia takin buan ngawp a, zocip siat hi. Tua ahikom a liam a bai le puan ekkeak sa in tua pa inn panin tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephesus khua a teang Jew te le Gentile te theampo in hi thu za uh hi; amate sia launa taw kidim in, Topa Jesus min kipatoai seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu um mite sung pan tam mama hong pai a, amate ngamtatnasate mipi mai ah kheet nei ngawlin pualaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mitbum thiam tam mama in a laibute khawmtua in hong paipui uh a, mipi mu tangin, mei taw haltham uh hi. A laibu man teng a kingawm ciang, ngunntang tul sawmnga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa thu sia hi bangin vaangletna taw kizel a, hat vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi thu teng a pian zawkciang Paul in Macedonia le Achaia ngam kaantan in khualhaw a, Jerusalem ah paitan tu in, khensat hi. Ama in “Tua munah ka pai zawkciang, Rome khuapi zongh ah ka haw kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama a hute nii Timothy le Erastuste zongh Macedonia ngam ah paisak a, ama ahile, Asia ngamkhen ah hun a tamzaw zangh thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi hun laitakin, Ephesus khua ah Topa ii Thu hangin buaina nasia khat hong om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Demetrius min nei ngunn seakpa in, a numeipathian Artemis ii biakinn limte veu, ngunn taw vawt a, ama nasepna pan a naseamte meetsak mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in, a naseam theampo le, tua nasepna taw a kibang a seam mihing dangte khawmtua in, “Pasalte awng, eite nopsakna in hi nasepna pan hong piang hi, ci in na heak tek uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu in hi Paul a ci sia pa ii ngamtatna babang noma tek in mu thei a, za thei nu hi. Ama in khut taw vawttawm pathian in pathian hi peuma ngawl hi ci a, hi sung Ephesus khua le Asia ngamkhen bup phialma ah mihing tam tatak umsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang ih nasepna a minsiat tu lauhuai hi. Tua bek dom ngawlin, Asia ngam le leitung mun theampo ii a biak tua a lian numeipathian Artemis ii biakinn zongh a luithawthong suakin — a letna teng a kisuksiat tu lauhuai hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihonpite in hi kamte a zaak uh ciangin, a thinso a, “Ephesus khua ah om Artemis ma lian hi!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ngamlumna sia khuapi bup kilaw hi. A ngilo nuam mihon in, Paul ii khualhawpui Macedonia te nii Gaius le Aristarchus pummat a, poai lakna inn ah taipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Paul in mihonte mai ah, pai nuam ahihang, thu um mite in a oai bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama lawm ngamkhen sungah thunei pawlkhatte in zongh poai inn ah ama le ama a kilaak ngawl natu in thu zasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua laitakin a kikhopna buppi sungah ngamlum seseam hi; pawlkhat in thu pawlkhat taw au a, a dangte in thudang khat taw au uh hi, banghang ziam cile mihing a tamzaw in, amate banghangin kikhawmtua ziam ci zongh a tel bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in Alexander maw hi vak ci uh hi, banghang ziam cile Jew te in ama sia mai ah paisak uh hi. Tuasia ciangin, Alexander in mihonpi a thim natu a khut vaanin ama a kihuk natu in, thuson tu hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang ama sia Jew te hi ci in a tel uh ciangin, a au ngei uh bangin, “Ephesus khua ah, Artemis lian hi!” ci in nai nii sung au hon uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A khakbel ciangin khuapi lai atpa in, mihonte thimsak thei hi. Ama in “Ephesus khuapuite awng! Ephesus khuapi sia a lian Artemis biakinn le vantung pan hong taaksuk suang thiangtho a keam sia ahi hunlam a kuama po in, ih heak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi thute kuama in nial thei ngawl tu hi. Tua ahikomin, note thim vun a, maitatna bangma vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in, biakinnte le phuul ngawl a, ih numeipathian huvau, kamsia le pau ngawl hi napi, note in pasal hite hi sungah hong paipui nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Demetrius le a naseamte in, mi pawlkhat tungah thu vawt nopna nei na hi uh le, thu neite le zumhon hun a maan thukhenzum ih nei hi; tua munah thu kivawt thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahihang tua sangin na dei zawk uh a om le, upadi bangin ngammite kikhopna ah khensat kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, tuni a thupiang teng zawkciang, ei tungah buaina piangsak hi, ci in maw hong kizon kik tu lauhuai hi. Hi bangin buai natu bangma thu om ngawl a, hisia hang ci zongh ih son thei tu bangma om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hi teng a ci zawkciangin, a ma in kikhopna tawpsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua buaina a thim zawkciang Paul in thu umte khawmtua a, hanthotna kammalte taw vaithakna nei hi. Tuaciang ama vaiding in Macedonia ah paisuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tuak a ngamte kaantan in pai a, thu tam mamate taw hanthawn hi. Tua zawkciangin Achaia ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua munah tha thum taam hi. Syria ah pai tu in a kingin laitak, tuak ah Jew te in ama a thasawm hunlam phawk hi; tua ahikom Macedonia tawnin, heak kik tu khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Berea khua mi Pyrrhus ii tapa Sopater in ama tonpui hi; Thessalonica khua pan Aristarchus le Secundus; Derbe khua panin Gaius; Asia ngamkhen panin Tychicus le Trophimus; Timothy zongh in tonpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate pai masa a, Troas panin ko hong ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poai zawkciang Philippi panin, teambaw taw ka ding uh a, ni nga zawkciangin amate taw Troas ah kisitua in, tua munah nipi khat sung hun ka zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nino nitakin neakkhopna nei tu in, ka kikaikhawm uh hi. Paul in a zing ciang vaiding tu ahikom, mite paupui a, zankim dong thuson hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kikhopna uh inn tung dawl sungah meiinn tam ma kide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eutychus kici tangval khat khelki tungah to a, Paul in tatsat ngawlin thuson ahikom, Eutychus zongh a mut suak vaial a, a khakbel ciangin, mutthip in, inn tung dawl thum panin, lei ah taaksuk hi. Amate in a top ciang, ama thi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Paul tuaksuk a, ama tungah bok in koai a, “Patau heak vun, ama nungta lai hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in inn tungah kaato in, anluum baltham in ne hi. Nisua dong amate taw ngei ma thu a son zawkciang, Paul in paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in tangvalpa sia a inn ah, a nungta in ciapui a, a thin uh nuam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koma in teambaw kungah ka pai masa uh a, teambaw taw Assos ka zuan uh hi. Tua munah, Paul in teambaw tungah hong kaa tu ahi hi. Ama in hi bang tu ma in, hong sonsa hi a, ama in lei lam tawnin tua munah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Assos ah ka kisik uh ciangin, teambaw tungah ama hong kaato a, Mitylene khua ah ka paisuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua mun panin teambaw taw ka ding uh a, a zing ciangin, Chios ngal ka theng uh hi. Ni khat zawkciangin, Samos ka theng uh a, a zing ciangin, Miletus ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asia ngamkhen sung tengah hun a bo thong ngawl natu in, Paul in Ephesus khua kaantan in, teambaw taw pai tu khensat hi. Hi thei le Pentecost ni lapin, ama Jerusalem khua a theng tu in pai memeang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Paul in Miletus panin, Ephesus ah thu zasak a, pawlpi upate ama taw a kimu natu in vaitha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate hong thet ciangin, Paul in amate tungah, “Asia ngamkhen ah kong thet phit ni pan kipan no taw hun bup bangbangin zangh khi ziam, ci sia na heak uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jew te ii hong thasawm hu in, haksatna hunte sungah Topa ii naseam bangin kiniamkhiakna theampo le, thitui tam mama taakin na ka seam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipite mai le noma inn uh ah thuhilna le hilciannate kong nei ciangin, note phattuam natu in bangma kheet ka nei ngawl sia na heak uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jew te le Gentile te tungah a kibangin a mawna tetek pan Pathian sangah kiheak kik a, ih Topa Jesus a up natu in, thupi takin kong phawksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in Thaa Thiangtho thu ka nitna taw Jerusalem ah pai tu khi hi, tua munah bang tat tu khi ziam he ngawl khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngimnate le thonginn in, keima hong ngak hi, ci in khuapi sim ma ah Thaa Thiangtho in hong phawksak hi ci sia bek ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang keima nuntakna sia bangma man nei ka sa bua hi; keima vaipuak ka khuangkhim natu le Topa Jesus ii nasep hong piak ahi, Pathian ii thuthiamna Lungdamna Thupha ka thansak tu ka man thiang tu bek ka uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Pathian Ngam thuhil in, note theampo sungah kong vak zo hi. Tuaciang note sung pan kuama in, kei nong mu kik ngei nawn ngawl tu uh sia tu in ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom tuni mama in, no tungah a ciliaphuai takin kong taangko hi: a mangthang khat po na om uh le, kei ii ka vaipuak lel hu hi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian tupna a buppi in kong sonna ah bangma kheet nei ngawl khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom noma le noma kikeam tavun a, Thaa Thiangtho ii noma khut sung a hong aap tuuhonte zongh en in keam tavun. A Tapa ii chisan tungtawnin, ama atu a piansak Pathian ii pawlpi ii tuucingte na hi tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kong nusiat zawkciangin, a kiitakhuai ngiate, no sungah hong pai tu a, tua tuuhon a khoaikhet ngawl tu sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Noma pawlsung pan ma in, pawlkhat in thu umte sia leilot thu taw amate a zui tu in, a zol tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahiciang encik tavun, kum thum sung sun taw zan taw thitui tam ma taakin note khat sim kong hilcian sia ciamtee tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tu in no sia Pathian kepna sung le a thuthiamna thu sungah kong aap hi, tuasia in ama mihing theampo hong puuato thei a, Pathian thuphate hong pia thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khamh ahizong, ngunn ahizong, puansilhte ahizong, kuama ii neisa ka dungawk ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka kitholpuite le keima kitaangsapna teng ka sik natu in hi ka khutte taw na ka sep sia noma tatak ma in, na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa Jesus mama in, ‘Saanna sangin piakna in lungdamna tamzaw hi’, a ci thu phawk kawmin, hi bangin nasia tak na sepna taw na theampo ah, a thazawmte ih hu nanak tu hi, ci in no tungah kong lak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Paul in a son tu teng a man ciang, amate taw khupdin in, thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in ama koai a namhin, a vaithak uh ciang, a vekpi ma in kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama a mu kik nawn ngawl natu, a son hu in, amate a tuanin khuangai uh hi. Tuaciang amate in teambaw kungah ama tha uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate ka vaitha uh a, ka nusia uh hi. Teambaw taw a tangtan in, ka pai uh ciang, Cos ka theng uh hi; a zing ciangin Rhodes ka theng uh a, tua mun panin Patara ka zuan suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah Phoenicia ah a pai tu teambaw khat ka mu uh hi, tua ahikom teambaw tungah kaato in, ka zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cyprus a kimu theina mun ka theng uh a, tua zawkciang a thangsang Syria ah ka pai uh hi. Tyre khua ah ka kaa uh a, tua mun sia teambaw vanh sua natu mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua munah thu um mi pawlkhat ka mu uh a, amate kungah nipi khat ka taam uh hi. Amate in Paul sia Jerusalem ah a pai ngawl natu in, Thaa vaangletna taw tho uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang amate taw hun ka zak zawkciangin, vai ka ding uh a, koma pai natu ah ka pai uh hi. Amate in a zite a tate taw khuapi puasia dong hong tha in, vaalbo ah ka vekpi khupdin in thu ka ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, khat le khat kivaitha in teambaw tungah ko ka kaa uh a, amate inn ah a cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui tung ka khualhawna uh ka zom uh a, Tyre pan, Ptolemais ah pai in, tua munah thu umte ka nukset uh a, amate kungah ni khat ka taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zing ciangin ka ding uh a, Caesarea ka theng uh hi. Tua khua ah thupha puak syapa Philip ii inn ah ka taam uh hi. Ama sia Jerusalem ah a kiteal husya sali sungah khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Pathian thu a thangsak, pasal a nei ngawl tanu li nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua munah ni tam ma ka taam uh sungin, Judea ngam panin, Agabus a kici kamsaang khat hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ko kungah hong pai a, Paul kawngkhau la in, ama le ama a khut a peang kisawm a, “Thaa Thiangtho cina pan: Hi kawngkhau a neipa sia Jerusalem ah hi bang danin Jew te in khaukhii tu a, Gentile te khut sungah aap tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi thu ka zaak uh ciangin ko le a dang teng in Paul tungah Jerusalem ah a pai ngawl natu in ka thuum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in, “Bang son nu ziam? Hi bangin kapin ka thin hong tamhsak nu ziam? Jerusalem ah khau kikhii bek dom ngawlin, Topa Jesus hangin, tua munah a thi tu ngawngawn zong kingingta zo khi hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thin zaw natu in ka sonpui zo bua uh a, ka ci ka law he ngawlin “Topa deina bang hi tahen,” ka ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tawmvei tua munah hun ka zak zawk uh ciangin, vanh teng kithoai in, Jerusalem ka zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Caesarea pan nungzuite pawlkhat zongh in hong tonpui a, ka taam natu uh Cyprus ngammi thu um ciil khat ahi Mnason inn ah hong then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem ka thet uh ciangin, thu umte in, nuam takin vai hong muak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zing ciangin, Paul taw James kungah ka haw uh hi; tua munah pawlpi upa theampo om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Paul in amate a nukset zawkciang, ama nasepnate tungtawnin, Pathian ii Gentile te sungah a sep a vawt theampo cing takin ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama thuson a zaak zawk uh ciangin, amate theampo in, Pathian pok uh hi. Tua zawkciangin, amate in Paul tungah, “Suapui Paul awng, Jew te mihing tul tam mama thu um hong suak zo uh a, amate theampo Thukham nasia takin, a zuite ahi sia na mu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate tungah nang ii thu a kisonna panin, Gentile ngamsung teng ah a teang Jew theampo ma in, Moses Thukham a nusiat natu, nangma in hilcian a, a tate ii vunteap a at ngawl natu le, Jew ngeinate a zui ngawl natu in sawl hi, ci thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in nang nong thet hunlam za nanak tu hi. Tua ahiciang bang law tu hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi bangin na ngamtat tu in, kong dei uh hi. Kiciamna a vawt sa pasal li hi sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate taw va paikhawm ta'n a, amate ii kithiansuana poai sungah kihel in, sum bona teng zongh piaksak ta'n; tuasia ciangin, amate in a lu uh meettol thei tu hi. Hi bangin hi leang nang thu huvau hong kisonna sia thumaan a hi ngawl hunlam le, nangma mama sia Moses Thukham bang a, a nungta pa na hina thu a kuama po in hong he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gentile te sung pan thu um a suakte ahile, lai khat thaak zo khu hi, milim biakna in a kizangh an lamsangte neak ngawl natu, chisan ahibuale nganhing a kitawlmeakte ii sa a neak ngawl natu, tuaciang numei le pa paktatna pan a kikep natu in, thu ka khensat uh te, ka son uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom Paul in, tua pasalte paipui a, a zing ciangin amate taw a kithiansua hi. Tua zawkciang, ama sia Biakinnpi sungah tum a, kithiansuana hun a man tu dong le amate khat sim atu in sangaw biakpiakna a piak thei tu hun sia zongh ni bangza hi tu ziam ci sia zasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang, a ni sali hun a bo dektak laitakin, Asia ngamkhen pan hong pai Jew te pawlkhat in, Paul sia Biakinnpi sungah mu uh hi. Amate in mihon bup hol in, Paul pummat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Israel pasalte awng! Hong hu tavun! Hisia pa sia mun theampo ah pai in, Israel te, Moses Thukham le hi Biakinnpi langpan in, hilcianna a neipa hi. Tu zonghin, ama in Gentile te pawlkhat Biakinnpi sungah paipui in, hi a thiangtho mun sia ninsak hi!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Hi bangin a ci theina sia Ephesus khua mi Trophimus sia Paul taw khuapi sungah kithawl khawm in mu uh a, Paul in, tua pa sia Biakinnpi sungah tumpui hi tu in muangmaw uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Telmeal om ngawlin khuapi bup thu kizel a, mihingte tai lialua in, Paul man uh a, Biakinnpi pan kaikeak uh hi. Thakhat thu in Biakinnpi kongkhate kikhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A ngilo nuam mihonpi in Paul thalup a sawm uh laitakin, Rome ngalkap hon ukpa tungah Jerusalem khua bup buai hi, ci in kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thakhat thu in tua ngalkap hon ukpa in ngalkap bu pawlkhat le ngalkap te samin mihonpite del uh hi. Mite in ngalkap bupa le a ngalkapte a mu ciangin, Paul sia a vel nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ngalkap hon ukpa in Paul kungah pai a, ama manin thikkhau nii taw khit tu in thupia hi. “Hi sia pa akua ziam? Ama in bang ngamtatna nei ziam,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihon sung pan pawlkhat in thu khat son a, a dangte in thudang taw au uh a, telmeal om ngawl ahikom, ngalkap hon ukpa in, bang thu tatak piang cisia a tel zo bua hi, tua ahikom ngalkapte teenna kulh huang sungah Paul paipui tu in, a mite sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Keallei dong paipui uh a, tua zawkciangin ngalkapte in, a puak kul hi, banghang ziam cile a ngilo nuam mihonpite thinso ngawp uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate theampo in, ama nung pan hong pai uh a, “That vun!” ci in aukeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngalkapte in kulh huang sungah Paul a tumpui dektak laitakin, ngalkap hon ukpa tungah, “Thu tawm kong son thei tu ziam?” ci hi. “Greek kampau hi ngawl ni ziam?” ci in ngalkap hon ukpa in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Tua ahile nang sia khatvei lai a, ngalphuang in sennealngam sungah ngalhiam toai mi ngilo tul li a lampui Egypt pa sia na hi bua na ziam?,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Paul in, “Keima in Jew mi ka hi a, Cilicia ngam Tarsus khua ah suakin, khuapi thupi khat ii ngammi ka hi hi. Hi mihingte tungah nong hesuakna in, thu hong sonsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in a khuan pia ahikom Paul in keallei tungah ding a, mihonte a thim natu in, a khut vik hi. Amate a thim uh ciangin, Paul in amate tungah Hebrew kam taw thuson hi:
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka mipui Jew te awng, note mai ah keima le keima ka kihuukna kammalte hong ngai tavun!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebrew kam in a pau a zaak uh ciang, amate thim seseam uh hi; tuaciang Paul in zom to lai a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kei sia Jew mi khat hi in, Cilicia ngam Tarsus khua ah ka suak a, ahihang hi sung Jerusalem ah, Gamaliel ii sangpatang khat in a khangto ka hi hi. Ih taanghpupite ii nasia takin Thukham kihil nate, ka sin zo hi, tuaciang tuni in hi sungah a om no theampo taw ma kibangin, kei zongh Pathian atu a ki aap mama pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi Lampi a zuite sia a thi dongin, a vawtsiapa ka hi hi. Pate le numeite manin, thong sung denna in, a neipa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbelpa le Council buppi in, ka son teng sia, thumaan hi ci in hong lak thei tu hi. Amate kung panin, Damascus a om, ih mipui Jew te a laithakte zongh keima in ka nga hi. Tua ahikom, tua munah a om hi mite man tu in ka pai a, tuaciang amate thikkol bul sa in, Jerusalem ah daan piak tu in ka ciapui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tuabangin khualhaw a, Damascus khua ka thet dektak sunkim laitak hun khawngin, thakhat thu in van pan, a taang mama khuavak khat in ka kiimkot hong taankeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei ah ka puk a, ‘Saul, Saul awng! Banghangin kei hong vawtsia ni ziam?’ hong ci aw khat ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Akua ni ziam Topa?’ ci in ka dongh hi. ‘Keima in nong vawtsiat Nazareth khua mi Jesus ka hi hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei taw a omkhawm mite in, khuavak taang sia mu ahihang, kei hong paupuipa aw a za bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Bang vawt tu khi ziam, Topa’ ci in ka dok ciangin, Topa in kei tungah, ‘Tho in a, Damascus khua sungah va pai ta'n, tua munah Pathian ii nangma sep tu hong seesak theampo hong kison tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />khuavak taang mama sia hu in, ka mit hong taw a, tua ahikom ka kitholpuite in, Damascus khua sung dong ka khut panin, hong len a hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tua khuapi sungah Ananias minnei pasal khat om a, ama sia biakna mi Thukham a zui tua munah a teang Jew te theampo ii a zatak pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama hong pai a ka kungah dingin, ‘Suapui Saul awng, khuamu kik in!’ hong ci hi. Tua hun lian laitakin, khua ka mu thei kik a, ama ka en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Ih taanghpupite ii Pathian in, ama deina a tel tu, a thutang a Naseampa a mu tu le ama aw taw a pau a za tu in nang hong teal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na mu le na zaak teng mihing theampo tungah a son tu in nang sia ama ii tetti khat na hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in banghang ngangak lai ni ziam? Tho in a, tui kiphumin, ama tung thungetna taw, na mawnate, kisilthiangsak in,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Jerusalem khua ah ka cia kik a, Biakinn sungah thungen in ka om laitakin, mukholna khat ka nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tua ii sungah Topa ka mu a, ama in, ‘Manlang takin Jerusalem nusia zok in, banghang ziam cile hi sungah a om mihingte in, kei huvau tetti na pan nate hong saang ngawl tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Topa awng, synagogue te ah ka pai a, nang hong umte manin ka vel bul sia, amate in pha takin hong he nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang, na tettipa Stephen a kithalup lai in keima mama zongh tua munah ka om a, a thalup tu thukim in, a thatte ii puantualte zongh kepsak lai khi hi,’ ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei tungah Topa in ‘Va pai ta'n,’ ‘banghang ziam cile a khualana Gentile te kungah kong puak tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paul ii hi bang teng a son ciang dong, amate in ngai uh hi; ahihang tua zawkciangin, amate in a aw nei za taw au a, “Ama heam vun! Thatlum vun! A nungta tu in kilawm ngawl hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in ciik au uh a, a puansilh uh vik in, vui sungah leivui lawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rome ngalkap hon ukpa in Paul sia kulh huang sungah paipuisak in, banghangin Jew te in hi bangin, ciik au in oksan ziam ci sia a kiheak thei natu ama vel in thu dongh tavun, ci in a mite thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang vel tu in a sawmcip uh ciang, a kung a ding ngalkap bupa munah Paul in, “Rome ngammi khat sia khialna lian khat pawpo atu thu kisit pepeu ngawl lai in, vel tu sia, no atu upadi taw kisi na ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngalkap bupa in tua thu a zaak ciang, ngalkap hon ukpa kungah pai in “Bang law tu ni ziam? Tuasia pa sia Rome ngammi khat hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngalkap hon ukpa Paul kungah pai in, “Hong son ta'n, Rome ngammi khat na hi ziam,” ci in dongh hi. “Hi khi hi,” ci in Paul in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in, “Sum tam mama ka piak ciangin kei zongh ngammi khat ka suak thei pheang hi,” ci hi. Paul in “Ahihang kei ka hile ka pian panin Rome ngammi khat khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thakhat thu in, Paul thu a dongh tute ama kung pan heak kik uh hi; Paul sia Rome ngammi khat hi ci in a heak ciang, thikkol a bulsak huvau ngalkap hon ukpa patau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in, Jew te in Paul sia bang teng tatak taw mawsiat ziam, ci in he nuam hi; tua ahikom a zing ciangin, a thikkol suusak a, tuaciang thiampi liante le Council bup kikhop natu in, thupia hi. Tuaciang, ama in Paul paipui a, amate mai ah dingsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul in Council te tangtan in en a, “Ka Israel mipuite awng! Pathian mai ah ka nuntakzia sia tuni mama dong ka thin thiangtho a, kithasunna nei ngawl khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbel Ananias in, Paul nai ah a dingte munah, a muk beksak vun, ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in, “Pathian in note hong vel tatak tu hi — no leikaang taw a kizut innpangte awng! Thukham taw kizui in, kei thu hong khen tu in, tuak ah na to uh a, ahihang kei vel tu a, na kisawl uh ciangin, Thukham paltan na hi uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Pathian Thiampi Lianbelpa selno ni hi!” ci in Paul kungah a om pasalte in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Paul in “Ka Israel mipuite awng, ama Thiampi Lianbel ahi hunlam ka he bua hi. Laithiangtho in, ‘Note ii na mite a ukpa sia sonsia thei ngawl tu nu hi,’ ci hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate sungah pawlkhat Sadducee te hi a, a dangte sia Phariseete hi ci in, Paul in a mu ciangin, Council te tungah, “Ka Israel mipuite awng! Kei in Pharisee te suan Pharisee khat ka hi hi. Hi sungah thusit ka thuak theina ii ahang sia mithi sa te tho kik tu hi, ci in lametna ka nei hang ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi thu a son po ciangin, Phariseete le Sadducee te kihau tu in, hong kipan paih a, tuaciang, Council upate sia hong kikhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Banghang ziam cile Sadducee te in thina panin mihingte tho kik ngawl tu hi, tuaciang, vantunglalang ahizong, thaa ahizong om ngawl hi, ci uh hi; ahihang Phariseete in, hi thu nam thum teng sia um siat hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Auna aw nging vaial a, Pharisee pawl mi Thukham hil sya pawlkhat hong ding a, nasia takin nalh uh hi: “Hisia pa tungah bangma khialna mu zo ngawl khu hi! Vantunglalang khat ziam, thaa khat ziam in, ama paupui takpi hi thei tu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kam kinialna uh a aw hong ngam vaial a, ngalkap hon ukpa in, Paul pumpi mama a kilaaithap tu lau hi. Tua ahikom tu a mipawlte sungah ngalkapte paisak a, amate kung pan Paul la keak in, ngalkap huang sungsang ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zan ciangin, Topa in Paul kungah ding a, “Lau heak in! Hi sung Jerusalem ah kei atu tetti pang zo ni hi, Rome khua sung zongh ah tuabang ma in, seam nanak lai tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zingsang ciangin Jew te pawlkhat kisitua in, ngealna khat nei uh hi. Amate in Paul a thalup mateng in an le tui ne ngawl tu hi, ci in kiciamna vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi bangin a ngeal khawmte mihing sawmli vaal pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in thiampi liante le upate kungah pai a, “Paul ka thalup uh mateng bangma ne ngawl tu, ci in thupi takin, ka kiciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang, tu in, noma le Council te in, Paul ii thu a maanzaw a kan nuam bangin, nong kiheang tu uh a, Rome ngalkap hon ukpa munah Paul hong paipui suk natu in na son tu uh hi. Ahihang hisung hong thet suk ma in, ama thatlum tu in ka kingingkhol tu uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Paul suapuinu ii tapa in, hi kisuam nopna thu za hi; tua ahikom kulh huang sungah pai in a thu bang teng Paul munah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Paul in ngalkap bute khat sam a, “Ngalkap hon ukpa kungah hi tangvalpa paipui ta'n; ngalkap hon ukpa munah son tu thu khat ama in nei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngalkap bupa in paipui in, ngalkap hon ukpa kung then a, “Thongtaak Paul in hi tangvalpa nang kungah paipui tu in hong sawl hi. Banghang ziam cile ama in nang tungah son tu thu khat nei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in a khut panin len a, ama mama in paipui in, “Kei tung nong son tu, bang thu nei ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Jew upa thuneite in, thukimna khat nei a, Paul ii thu a maan zaw kan nuam bangin, kivawt theam in, Council te kungah Paul na paipuisuk natu in, zing ciang hong ngen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang amate thu na um heak in, banghang ziam cile mihing sawmli vaal in, ama pangin ngak tu uh hi. Ama a thalup mateng, anne ngawl tuidawn ngawlin, om tu in kiciamna vawt zo hi. Tu in amate in tuabang vawt tu in, kingingta zo a, nangma thukhensatna hong ngak lai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in, “Hi thu teng nong ko hunlam kuama tungah son heak in,” ci in tangvalpa ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, ngalkap hon ukpa in, ngalkapbu nii sam a, “Tu nitak nai kua in ngalkapte zanii Caesarea ah pai tu in, kithoaisak vun a, tuate taw a kop tu in, siphu ngalkap sawmsali le tei toai zanii taw a ding tu in kithoaisak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Paul to natu siphu pawlkhat zongh, vaihawmsak tavun a, ngamuk mangpa Felix kungah a pha takin then tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, ngalkap hon ukpa in, hi bangin lai khat at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Claudius Lysias in a zatak huai ngamuk mangpa Felix kong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jew te in hisia pa man a, thatlum tu in kithoai hi. Ama sia Rome ngammi khat hi ci in ka heak hu in, ka ngalkapte taw pai in ka suatak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in bang teng mawsak nuam ziam ci in ka heak nopna taw amate ii Council ah ka paipui suk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei muna pan ama in thi natu ahizong, thongtaak natu ahizong, a thuak natu za dongin ngamtat khialna bangma nei ngawl hi; a maw zonna uh sia amate thukham taw bek kisai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang Jew te pawlkhat in a thasawmna uh ka zaak ciangin, nangma kungah puak tu in thakhat thu in ka khensat hi. Ama a mawsakte munah, ama sia nangma mai ah thu vawt tavun ka ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngalkapte in thupiaknate seam suak uh hi. Amate in, Paul la a, tua nitakin, Antipatris dong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A zing ciangin peang a pai ngalkapte sia kulh huang ah heak kikin, siphu ngalkapte taw paisuak tu in aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in Caesarea ah paipui uh a, ngamuk mangpa lai pia in, Paul sia ama tungah aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ngamuk mangpa in, laithak sim a, Paul munah bang ngamkhen sung pan ni ziam ci in dongh hi. Cilicia ngam pan ahi hunlam a tel ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ama in “Thu hong sua nuamte hong thet ciangin, na thu kong sit tu hi,” ci hi. Tua zawkciangin ama in, Paul sia ngamuk mangpa phualpi ah a cingte taw a kikoi natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni nga zawkciangin, Thiampi Lianbel Ananias in Caesarea ah upa pawlkhat le sitni Tertullus taw pai hi. Amate in Felix mai ah pai in, Paul a mawsakna thute son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, Paul samin, Tertullus in Paul a mawsakna thu hi bangin son hi: “A zatakhuai pa awng! na ciimna taw nong lampui hu in, khuangei mama sung kilemna om a, ih ngam phattuam natu, a kul kipuuaphatna tam ma kivawt saan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mun theampo ah a tawntungin, hi thu kiza nuam a, nangma tungah kilungdam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong na hun tam lei hong laaksak nuam ngawl khi hi, tua ahitazong, koma thu tawm kong son tu sia, nong ngai natu hesuak kong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hisia pa sia a kiitakhuai mihing nawngkai khat in ka mu uh hi; ama in leitung mun theampo ah a om Jew te sungah, buaina phuang pa hi a, Nazarenes pawl ii lampuipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi ninsak tu in zongh hanciam ahi hu in ka man uh hi. Koma thukham taw kizui in, ama tungah thukhen tu ci in ka ngeal uh hang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ngalkap hon ukpa Lysias hong pai a, zawthawk thu taw ko khut sung pan hong sut hi. Tuaciang ama a mawsak nuamte in nangma mai ah hong pai natu in, Lysias in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hisia pa thu dongh lete, nangma ma in, ama ka mawsakna uhte tel siat tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jew te in hi mawna a kisotna sungah, hong pawm hon uh a, hi thu theampo maan hi, a ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngamuk mangpa in, Paul ii pau natu in, a khut taw sawl hi. Paul in, “Hi minam tungah kum tam mama thukhenin na om kong he a, tua ahikom nangma mai ah keima le keima ka kihuk tu sia ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma hantang in thu kan theipa na hi bangma, tu nung ni sawm le ni nii sangin a tamzaw ngawl hun lai, biakpiakna vawt tu in Jerusalem ah ka pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah khat po taw kam kinialna ahizong, synagogue le khuapi sung mundang ah, mite hol in ngamlumsak natu hanthotna ahizong, ngamta ka hi hunlam Jew te in hong mu ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in hong mawsiat nate zongh maan hi ci in, hong lak thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na mai ah ahi bang ka pualaak nop thu panin, amate ii maan ngawl hi a ci tua Lampi zui in ka taanghpupite ii Pathian ka bia hi. Ahihang Moses Thukham le kamsaangte thubute sung a ki at theampo sia kei zongh in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi lai ah a om mihingte bangma in Pathian sungah lametna kibang khat ka nei thu sia, a pha taw a sia taw mihing theampo in thina pan tho kik tu ci thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Pathian mai le mihingte mai ah, kithasunna om ngawl thinsung thiangtho ka nei natu in, ka hanciam thei za in ka seam tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Kum tam mama sung Jerusalem ka nusiat zawkciang, ka mite kungah sum pawlkhat kengin, sangaw biakpiakna vawt tu in, tua munah ka pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah kithiansuana a zeksa nate, ka man zawkciang, tua biakpiakna ka vawt laitakin, amate in hong mu hi. Tua munah keima taw mihon om ngawl a, buaina bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Asia ngamkhen panin, Jew te pawlkhat om hi; tua mite in kei langpan natu nei ahile, amate mama hi sung na mai ah hong pai kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahibuale zong, Council mai ah ka din lai in, bangbang khialna lian ka vawt hong mu ziam ci in hi sungah a om mite in sonsak in —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amate mai ah ka din lai in: ‘Mithite in tho kik tu hi, ci thu ka up hangin, tuni in nong thusit uh ka thuak hi,’ ci in ka son tu simngawl ka son tu dang om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Felix in, Lampi ii thu a heak siat sa ahiciang, thusitna tawlngasak hi. Ama in “Ngalkap hon ukpa Lysias hong thet ciangin, na thu uh kong khensak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in Paul a keam ngalkap bupa munah, Paul sia a kepcing natu thupia ahihang, ama suatakna pawlkhat le a kitaangsapte a lawmte in a piak thei natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni tawmvei zawkciangin, Felix le Jew mi ahi a zi Drusilla hong pai uh hi. Ama in Paul samsak a, Jesus Christ ih upna huvau a thusonna ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in ngamtat phatna, pumpi kitekna le, Thukhen Ni hong thet natu thute kikuppui top a, Felix sia lau hi. “Tu in na pai phot ta'n, hunpha ka nga ciangin, kong sam kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua laitak ma in, Paul in ama sumnguk pia tu in muangmaw hi; tua hu in ama samsak nithi in thu son pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kum nii a kan zawkciangin, Porcius Festus in ngamuk mangpa Felix ii za laih hi. Felix in Jew te tung pan, maipha nga nuam ahikom, Paul sia thong sungah nusia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngamkhen sungah hong thet zawk ni thum ni ciangin, Festus in Caesarea panin Jerusalem zuan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua munah thiampi liante taw kikopin, Jew lampuite in, Paul langpanin thu vawt uh hi. Amate in Festus munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul sia Jerusalem ah a paisak natu ngen uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in, lampi ah suamlup sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Festus in, “Paul sia Caesarea ah thongtaak in kikoi hi. Keima mama zongh hai ngawlin tua munah heak kik tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lampuite sia Caesarea ah keima taw paikhawm in, Paul in khialna khat po vawt ahile, ama tungah maw kisuanh tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Festus in amate kungah ni liat pan ni sawm dong bang a taam zawkciangin, Caesarea ah pai hi. A zing ciangin thukhenna zum ah to in Paul a sungtan pui natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Paul a thet ciangin Jerusalem pan hong pai Jew te in, a kiimkot ah dingin, a nasia mawsakna tam mama nei ahihang amate in, a maan takin a lak thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in ama le ama kihung a, “Jew te Thukham langpanna ahizong, tua ahibuale Biakinnpi langpanna ahizong, Rome Kumpilianpa langpanna ahizong, bangma sep khial nei ngawl khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Festus in Jew te ii maipha nga nuam ahikom, Paul munah “Jerusalem ah pai in, hi maw kisotnate huvau sia, tualai keima mai ah thusitna na thuak nuam ziam,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paul in, “Kumpilianpa ii thukhenna zummai ah thusit thuak tu in ka ding hi. Nangma mama ii na heak bangin, Jew te tungah bangma sep khial nei ngawl khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thi daan taw kiphu in, thukham paltanna le sepna khat po nei hi leng suatak natu kong ngen bua hi. Ahihang amate ii kei tungah, maw hong sot nopnate sungah thumaan om ngawl ahile, amate khut sungah kuama in kei hong aap thei ngawl tu hi. Kumpilianpa tungah a zukhaan khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Festus in, ama ngaisutna a pia upate taw a kikup zawkciangin, “Kumpilianpa tungah a zukhaan zo na hikom Kumpilianpa kungah pai tu ni hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hun tawmvei zawkciangin, Kumpipa Agrippa le Bernice sia Festus taw kimu nuam in Caesarea ah haw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah ni tam ma a om zawkciang, Festus in Paul omzia sia kumpipa tungah sonthiang hi. “Hi sungah Felix ii a nusiat thongtaak pasal khat om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaciang, Jerusalem ah ka pai ciangin, Jew te ii thiampi liante le upate in, ama tungah thu vawtin, mawsak natu hong ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang ko Rome mite in khialna lian khat taw a kimawsiat mihing khat pawpo sia ama tungah maw a suanhte taw maitang kisi in, ama tungah a kisuanh mawnate panin, ama le ama a kihuk natu hun a nga mateng, kuama khut sungah aap thei ngawl ka hi uh hunlam ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate hi sungah hong pai ciangin, hun bosak thong ngawlin, a zing ciang mama in, thukhenna zum ah ka to a, a mihing pa sia hong paipui natu in ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama a langpante hong ding a, ahihang ka muanmawk bangin, a sia khialna liante taw a mawsiat bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate vai theampo sia a biakna le Jesus min nei mihing thisa khat ii thu huvau a kinial uh teng ahi hi; Paul in tua pa sia nungta hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi thute tungtaang ah thu a cingin ka nga thei natu lam sia, ka khensat thei paih bua hi, tua ahikom Paul munah hi mawsiatnate huvau in Jerusalem ah, thu na kisit nuam ziam, ci in ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in a zukhaan hi; ama a kicin lai natu le, Kumpilianpa ii thu a khen natu, ngen hi. Tua ahikom Kumpilianpa kungah ka puak thei dong, ama a kicin lai natu in, thu ka pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Agrippa in Festus munah, “Kei mama in hisia pa ii thuson za nuam khi hi,” ci hi. “Zing ciangin ama ii thuson za tu ni hi,” ci in Festus in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A zing ciangin Agrippa le Bernice sia, mipi kikhopna inndoi sungah ngalkap ukpite le khuapi lampui upate taw, nasia tak kithoai in hong pai a, kiletsakna taw hong tum uh hi. Festus in thupia a, Paul tumpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Festus in, “Kumpipa Agrippa le hi sungah ko taw a omkhawmte theampo awng: hi sung le Jerusalem a om Jew te theampo ii kei tungah hong khiakpa sia hisia pa hi a, mu tek nu hi. Amate in ciik au uh a, nungta nawn mama heak hen, ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang thidaan taw a kiphu tu ngamtatna nei hi, ci in ka mu zo bua hi. Tuaciang, ama mama in Rome Kumpilianpa tungah a zukhaan ahiciang puak tu in ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Kumpilianpa tungah ama thu huvau a kician lai at tu bangma ka nei bua hi. Tua ahikom noma mai hi sungah kong paipui hi — a tuanin Kumpipa Agrippa mai ah kong paipui hi! tua hile a thu a kikat zawkciangin, thu pawlkhat ka at tu om thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, ama mawna hi bang teng hi ci in, a kician om ngawl pipi in, thongtaak pa khat ka puak tu sia, suak thei ka sa bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Agrippa in Paul munah, “Nangma thu sia nangma mama ii son thei natu thu kong pia hi,” ci hi. Paul in a khut laam in, ama le ama sia hi bangin kihung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kumpipa Agrippa awng! Jew te ii maw hong zonna theampo pan, tuni in na mai ah keima le keima ka kihun thei tu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a tuanin Jew te ngeinate le a thu kinial theina theampo pha takpi in tel na hikom hampha ka kisa hi. Tuaciang thinsau takin nong ngai natu in kong thuum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Jew te theampo in ka no tuung a kipan, ka nuntakzia hong he hi. A masa in keima pianna ngam le tua zawkciang Jerusalem khua ah ka nuntakzia theampo hong he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in tetti hong pansak nuam thong le, a ciil panin, biakna sungah a phinciingbel Pharisee pawlmi khat ka hi sia, hong heak tawntung sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciang tu in hi sungah thusit ka thuakna ii ahang sia Pathian ii taanghpupite tungah kamciam a piakte ka lamet hu ahi hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />koma minam sawm le niite ii a sun a zanin Pathian ka biak uh ciang tua kamciam bangin nga tu sia ko ii lamet thu ahi hi. Vaangnei Kumpi awng, hi lametna hangin, Jew te in kei sia hong mawsak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghangin no hi sungah a omte in, a thisate sia Pathian in thosak kik tu in um thei ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima mama in Nazareth mi Jesus thu langpanin ka sep thei za in seam tong a ci pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabang sia Jerusalem ah ka ngamtatna ahi hi. Thiampi liante tung panin, thu ka nga a, Pathian ii mihingte tam ma thong sungah ka khum hi; tuaciangin, amate sia thidaan a kipiak ciangin, kei zongh in ka thukimpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamvei ma, synagogue te ah daan ka piasak a, a upna uh a kheal thei natu in, ka hanciam hi. Amate tungah ka thin uuk mama ahikom, ngamdang a khuapite ngawngawn ah, ka pai a ka vawtsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hi bang tupna le sawmna seam tu in, Damascus khua ah ka pai a, thiampi liante ii thuneina le thupiaknate ka keng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa awng, lampi tungah sun laitakin ni sangin, a taang zaw khuavak taang khat in kei le ka khualhawpuite, kiim ah van panin hong taangsuk keak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka vekpi in lei ah ka puk uh hi. Tuaciang aw khat ka za a, kei tungah Hebrew kam in, ‘Saul, Saul awng! Banghangin hong vawtsia ni ziam? Khuital khat in a neipa ii toai ngan hawlna ciang sia a peak kik bangin, nangma le nangma kikha kik in kiliamsua ni hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Akua ni ziam? Topa’ ci in ka dongh hi. Tuaciang Topa in, ‘Kei sia nong vawtsiat Jesus khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang tho in a ding in, nang tungah kong kilakna sia ka naseam tu a, kong koi nop hang ahi hi. Tuni a keima nong mu teng le maisang a kong lak pheang tu teng midangte munah son tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in Israel te khut sung pan le nangma kong puak natu Gentile te khut sung panin kong suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang in amate mit na honsak tu a, amate sia khuazingna sung panin, khuavakna ah, Satan vaangletna panin, Pathian kungah na kiheaksak tu hi. Tua hile amate in keima hong upna tungtawnin, a mawnate uh kimaisak tu a, Pathian tealsa mite sungah amate in omna nga tu uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tua ahikom, Kumpipa Agrippa awng, vantung pan ka nga mukholna sia ni ngawlin ka om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A masa phitbel in Damascus le Jerusalem ah, tua zawkciangin, Judea ngam bup le Gentile te sungah, amate in a mawnate kisiik nanak a, Pathian sangah kiheak in, a kisii kikna thu a lak tu nasepte a sep natu in, thu ka hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi thu hangin, Jew te in Biakinnpi sungah ka om laitakin hong man a, thatlum tu in, hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tuni mama dong Pathian in hong hu top zo ahikom, hi sungah dingin a lian a no mi theampo tungah a kibangin, tetti ka pang hi. Tuabang ka son sia in kamsaangte le Moses ii hong tung tu hi ci in a sonkhol teng ma ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jew te le Gentile te tungah ngupna khuavak thu thangsak tu in, Messiah in hong thuak kul tu a, thina panin a tho kik phitbel ahi tu hi, ci sia thu ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Paul in ama le ama hi bang a kihuk ciangin, Festus in oksan a, “Paul awng, na thin amh hi! pilna tam na sinna in na thin hong amhsak hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Paul in, “Kei ka thin amh ngawl hi, A zatakhuai pa awng, keima in thumaan thutak ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa Agrippa awng! Nang tungah hang takin hong son thei khi hi; banghang ziam cile nangma in hite huvau he ni hi. A piang sa nate khat simin, ciamtee tu in kong um hi, banghang ziam cile, hi thu sia a kingsong khat ah a piangku thu hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa Agrippa awng, kamsaangte na um ziam? Na up sia hong he khi hi!” Paul in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Agrippa in Paul munah, “Hi hun tomno sungah Tapidaw hong suaksak zo tu in ki um ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hun tom kale, sau kale, nang le tuni a ka thuson hong ngaite theampo, hi thikkolte kihel ngawlin, keima bang na hi thei natu uh sia Pathian tungah ka thungetna ahi hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Kumpipa, ngamuk mangpa, Bernice le a dang teng ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a nusiat zawk uh ciangin, khat le khat tungah, “Hisia pa in thongtaak natu ahizong, thi natu ahizong, bangma vawt nei ngawl hi,” kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Agrippa in Festus munah, “Kumpilianpa tungah a zukhaan ngawl hile, hisia pa kisuatasak thei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Italy ah teambaw taw pai tu in a kikhensat zawkciang Paul le thongtaak dang pawlkhat sia “Kumpilianpa ii ngalkaphon” a kici Roman ngalkapte ii ngalkap bu Julius tungah amate in aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Adramyttium pan teambaw khat tungah ka kaato uh hi, tuasia in Asia ngamkhen a teambaw tawlngakna sang zuan tu in a kithoai teambaw hi a, tua taw ka ding uh hi. Thessalonica khua pan, Macedonia mi Aristarchus taw ka ton uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zingsang ciangin, Sidon ka theng uh hi. Julius sia Paul tungah hong dik a, a kitaangsap pawpo a kipiak thei natu in, a lawmte kungah hawsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua mun panin ka paisuak uh a, ko sangah vui hong lee vak ahikom, a kibeal theina Cyprus tuikulh pangh vui kidalna mun tawnin ka pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cilicia le Pamphylia hui panin, tuipi ka kan uh a, Lycia ngam Myra khua ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua munah ngalkap bupa in, Alexandria pan Italy ngam a zuan tu teambaw khat mu a tua teambaw tungah hong kaasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni tam ma dam takin, ka pai uh a, a khakbel ciangin, Cnidus khua hui dong haksa pi in ka theng uh hi. Tuak sangah ka paitan thei ngawl natu in, vui in hong khak ahikom, Salmone leidok hui panin Crete tuikulh pangh vui kidalna mun bealhin ka paisuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipi vaalbo ka neak uh a, Lasea khua pan a kikhuala ngawl Muanhuai Teambaw tawlngakna kicina mun haksa pi in ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah ni tam mama taam ka hi uh kom, tu in Mawsuutna Ni zongh kan zo a, tui lam taw khualhaw tu sia lauhuai hi. Tua hikom, Paul in amate sia hi ngaisutna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pasalte awng, ih khualhawna sia, hi sung pan kipan, lauhuai tu in ka mu hi; vanhte le teambaw ii tungah siatna lian piang tu a, mihing thina zongh om tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang ngalkap bupa in, teambaw ukpa le a neipa thuson um zaw a, Paul sonte sia a thupi laak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Teambaw tawlngakna mun in phalbi sung om natu a phabel mun ahi bua hi; tua ahikom, mihing a tamzaw in, ahithei le, tuipi tungah paisuakin phalbi sung teng a om thei natu mun Phoenix thet tu hanciam nuam uh hi. Crete a om Phoenix teambaw tawlngakna sia nitumna thangsang le nitumna saksang maingat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thangsang panin vui hong va vahiau a, mihingte in a tupna uh bangin, pai thei tu in ki um uh hi. Tua ahikom tawlngaksakna thikkip dokto in, Crete vaalbo hui a neak thei zaza neakin pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang hai ngawlin, “Nisuana saksang vuipi” kici, vui thahat khat tuikulh panin hong vasuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vui in teambaw sawn a, vui sang maingat in, kipai thei nawn ngawl ahikom, hanciam tuan nawn ngawlin, vui ii seamna pawpo ah ka pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cauda tuikulh no ii thangsang ka kan uh ciangin, belh natu tawm om hi. Tua munah teambaw taw a kikop ngunkuang sia haksa pi in, a lal ngawl natu in ka huu zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in teambaw tungah tuasia kaito in, teambaw kiimkot khauzeen pawlkhat taw sawmcip uh hi. Amate in, Libya ngam sen vaalbote phulin teambaw a awk tu lau uh hi. Tua ahikom amate in, teambaw puankhakte, luak in, vui ii sawnna pawpo ah pai tu in a om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Suangval thahat sia, hong kizom tan ahikom, a zing ciangin, teambaw sungah a puak uh vanh pawlkhat tuipi sungah khia uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a zing ciangin teambaw taw kisai vanhzak pawlkhat tuipi sungah khia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni tam mama hun sung, ni ahizong, aksi ahizong, ka mu thei bua uh hi. Tuaciang vui nasia takin hong va tan hi. A khakbel ciangin, suatak natu lametna bangma ka nei nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingte sia an ne ngawlin, khuangei a om zawkciang, Paul in amate mai ah dingin, “Pasalte awng, ka thuson hong ngai pole uhte a, Crete panin din awl hi po leang hiza supna le lalna taw kipeal tu ve hing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tu in kong thuum hi. Na thin uh liansak vun! Note khat zongh in, na nuntakna taan ngawl tu nu hi; teambaw bekma kisumh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama ii neisa ka hi a, ka biak Pathian ii vantunglalang khat tu zanin hong pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Paul awng, lau heak in! Kumpilianpa mai ah na din kul tu hi. Pathian in nang tungah hong phatna taw na khualhaw pui theampo ii nuntakna suatak zo ni hi’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom, pasalte awng, thinlian vun! Banghang ziam cile, Pathian ka muang a, kei tungah hong kison bangin, tung tu hi, ci in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang eite sia tuikulh khat ii vaalbo ah hong kisawn tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni sawm le ni li ni zanin, vuipi suangval in, Mediterranean tuipi sungah ko hong then hi. Zankim hun khawngin, teambaw naseamte in, lei taw kinai zo vak hing, ci in ummaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom khau khat ii tungah, a ngit khat sawm a, a khiaksuk uh le, metre 40 thuk hi ci in mu hi; tawmvei zawkciangin, a tee kik uh le metre 30 thuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in teambaw sia suangpi tung a tot thaak tu lau ahikom, teambaw nungsang panin, tawlngaksakna thikkip li khia suk a, khuavak natu in, thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zawkciang teambaw naseamte in, teambaw panin a suatak natu in, hanciam uh hi; ngunkuang sia tui sungah khiasuk in, teambaw maisang panin, tawlngaksakna thikkip pawlkhat khia tu bangin kiheang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in ngalkap bupa le ngalkapte munah, “Hi teambaw naseamte sia teambaw tungah a om po bua uh le, no suatak natu lamet om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahikom a ngunkuang khii na khau attan uh a, ngunkuang sia tui in taisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khua hong vak mahiat in, Paul in a vekpi in, an tawm tek a neak natu in thuum a: “Tu in ni sawm le ni li ngak zo nu hi. Hi hunsung teng bangma neak nei ngawl nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahiciang an tawm tek na neak natu uh in, kong thuum hi; na thi ngawl natu in, an kitaangsamh hi. Na lu tung a samzam khat zongh, sum ngawl tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi bangin a ci zawkciang, Paul in anluum pawlkhat la in, Pathian pok in, amate theampo mai ah balneen in ne tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate a thinlian a, mihing simin anluum ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A vekpi kingawm in, mihing 276 teambaw tungah ka om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mihing simin, an a neak siat zawk uh ciangin, amate in zungtaang teng tuipi sungah vawkin teambaw vanh zaangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khua hong vak ciangin, teambaw naseamte in, vaalbo a tel meal bua uh hi. Ahihang amate in, vaalbo a nei tuidok khat mu ahikom, ahithei le tua munah teambaw sia kingaksak sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in tawlngaksakna thikkipte ii khau attan in, tui sungah khiasuk uh a, teambaw heaknate sawmna khau a phel paih uh hi. Tua zawkciang vui in teambaw sia, a mai sangah a sawn natu, amate in teambaw mai sangah puan khai a, tuaciang vaalbo sang ka manaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahihang teambaw in sen bo khat phul a, lei ah kinga hi; teambaw maisang sia awk in, a tung thei nawn bua hi. Tua laitakin tuihual nasia mama ahikom, teambaw nungsang teng a bebek in tamhtham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ngalkapte in, thongtaak theampo tui op a, vaalbo ah a suatak ngawl natu in, thalup sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahihang ngalkap hon ukpa in, Paul hunnuam ahikom, tuabangin a ngamtat ngawl natu in tho hi. Tua hi ngawl zaw in, tui op thei peuma, teambaw tung panin, leangin, vaalbo dong tui a op natu thupia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />a dangte in zui in, thingpheak ahizong, teambaw bek ahizong, a pom tek natu thupia hi. Hi bangin ka vekpi ma vaalbo ah ngammuang takin ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngammuang in vaalbo tung ka thet uh ciang, tua tuikulh sia Malta hi ci in ka he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah a teang mihingte in, hong pawlvawt mama uh hi. Nguazu tu kithoai in khuasik mama ahikom, amate in meimang sep in, hong muak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in thingkang lom khat toai in, mei sungah a thut ciangin, meisa thuak la in, ngul khat hong pusuak a, ama khut tungah hong kivial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khua mite in, Paul khut tungah a kaai ngul a mu uh ciangin khat le khat sia, “Hi sia pa in tualthat khat hi nak tu hi. Tuipi pan suakta ahihang a nuntak tu sia Thumaan in oai ngawl hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Paul in, tua ngul sia mei sungah thing a, ama bangma tat ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Paul sia a ci a sa tum keak tu a, tua ahibuale, pukvawk in a thi tu ngak hi. Ahihang ngei hialma a thi tu a ngak zawk uh ciang, a tumdang piang ngawl ahikom, a ngaisutna uh kheal kik a, “Ama sia pathian khat hi ei!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua mun panin a khuala ngawlna ah tuikulh ukpa Publius ii neisa lo pawlkhat om hi. Ama in hong muak a, ni thum sung zin hong do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Publius ii pa sia ciisuk natna le ngilsan natna taw lupmuntung ngak hi. Paul in, ama ii inndoi sungah tumin, thungen a, ama tungah a khut nga in damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi bangin hong pian ciangin, tuikulh tung a cina dang theampo zongh hong pai tek a, dam siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in letsong tam ma hong pia a, teambaw taw ka din uh ciangin, khualhawna sung a ka kisap uh nate amate in teambaw tungah hong koisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tha thum zawkciangin, Alexandria panin, phalbi hunsung tua tuikulh tungah a taam “The Twin Gods (Apeang Pathiante)” a kici teambaw khat taw ka ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Syracuse khuapi ka theng uh a, ni thum ka taam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua mun panin ka ding suak uh a, Rhegium khuapi ka theng uh hi. A zing ciang, thangsang panin, vuiva tu in hong kipan hi, tuaciangin ni nii sungin Puteoli khua ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah thu um pawlkhat ka mu uh a, amate in nipi khat taamin hong sawl hi. Tua mun panin, Rome khua ka theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rome a thu umte in ko thu hong za a, Appius Sumbuk le Zin inn Thum a kicina khuate dong hong muak uh hi. Paul in amate a mu ciangin, Pathian tungah lungdamko in, tha nga tuam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rome khua sungah ka thet uh ciangin, Paul sia ama nguakin, a cing ngalkap khat taw kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni thum zawkciangin, Paul in tua munah a om Jew lampuite sam a, kikhopna khat vawt hi. Amate hong kikhop ciang, amate tungah, “Ka Israel mipuite awng, ih mite tungah ahizong, taanghpupite tung pan ih lua ngeina zeksate tung ahizong, langpanna bangma nei ngawl napi, Jerusalem ah kei thong hong taaksak a, Rome mite tungah hong aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rome mite in kei thu hong sit zawkciang, thi natu kilawm bangma sep nei ngawl ka hi komin, hong tha nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Jew te in tuabang tu sia nial ahikom, Kumpilianpa tungah ka zukhaan kul hi, tua ahihang, ka mipuite langpanin mawsak natu ka nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hangin, no taw kimu in kong paupui natu ka nget ahi hi. A tatak ci leang, Israel mite ii a lamet uh pa hu in, hi bangin kei thikkol hong kibul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in ama munah, “Kote in nang thu huvau sia Judea panin, laithak ka nga bua uh hi, tua mun panin, ih mipuite hong pai in, nang taw kisai thupiang khat pawpo ahibuale a sia son tu khat po hong puak bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang nangma ngaisut nate ka za nuam uh hi, banghang ziam cile, mun theampo ah mihingte in, na pawl puite a siatson tek sia ka he uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Paul taw a ni kiciam a, tua ni in mihing tam mama Paul omna ah hong pai uh hi. Zingsang pan zan dong, amate tungah Pathian Ngam thu hil thiang a, Moses Thukham le kamsaangte lai at nate sisanh in, Jesus thu a tel thei natu hanciam in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawlkhatte sia ama kammalte um uh a, ahihang a dangte in, a um bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom, amate kithukim thei ngawlin, Paul ii hi bangin, a ci zawkciang nusia uh hi. “Thaa Thiangtho in, Isaiah kamsaangpa tungtawnin, na taanghpupite tungah a sonna sia bangza in pha ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama in, ‘Pai in hi mite tungah son in: No in na ngangai, na ngangai tu a, ahihang na tel buatu uh hi; Na e en, na e en tu uh a, ahihang na mu buatu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />banghang ziam cile, hi mite ii thin sia bulthu hi, amate in a bil uh humcip a, a mit uh si hi. Tua hi buathong le, amate ii mit in mu tu a, a bil taw a za tu uh hi, tuaciang a thinsung in a tel tu uh hi, tuaciangin kei sangah hong kiheak tu a, amate ka damsak tu hi,’ Pathian in ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang Paul ii thukhupna ah: “Tuasia ciang, Pathian ii ngupna thu sia Gentile te tungah, kipuak zo hi ci in note in na heak tu uh ahi hi. Amate in ngai tu hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Paul in hi teng a ci zawkciang Jew te amate teng nasia tak kinialin a cia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Paul in kum nii sung atu a saap inn sungah teang a, ama taw a kimu tu in a pai theampo leangna do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in hangsan tak le suakta takin Pathian Ngam thuhil a, Topa Jesus Christ thu hilcian hi.
  </para>
</usx>
